DESCRIPTION:Free First Thursdays at SF’s Museum of Craft and Design\nMin
 nosh Zomorrodinia\nThere’s no better time to visit the Museum of Craft a
 nd Design than on their Free First Thursdays.\nCommitted to making art\, c
 raft\, and design accessible to everyone\, the Museum of Craft and Design 
 is free on the first Thursday of every month.\nMuseum of Craft and Design
 ’s Free First Thursdays\nEvery First Thursday | Noon to 5pm\nMuseum of C
 raft and Design\n2569 Third Street (between 22nd and 23rd)\, San Francisco
 \nRSVP | Free Admission\nThe MCD is closed on New Year’s Day\, Martin Lu
 ther King Day\, Memorial Day\, Juneteenth\, July 4-5\, Labor Day\, Indigen
 ous People’s Day\, Thanksgiving\, and Christmas Day.\n2026 Free First Th
 ursday Dates\n\nJanuary 8\, 2026*\nFebruary 5\, 2026\nMarch 5\, 2026\nApri
 l 2\, 2026\nMay 7\, 2026\nJune 4\, 2026\nJuly 2\, 2026\nAugust 6\, 2026\nS
 eptember 3\, 2026\nOctober 1\, 2026\nNovember 5\, 2026\nDecember 3\, 2026\
 n\n*MCD will be closed on the first Thursday in January\, so they’ll be 
 hosting Free First Thursday on the 2nd Thursday\, January 8\, 2026. Please
  note that in addition to major holidays\, the museum may be closed for ex
 hibition changeovers so please check their schedule before attending.\n*Pl
 ease note that in addition to major holidays\, the museum may be closed fo
 r exhibition changeovers\, so please check their schedule before attending
 .\n\nSpecial Exhibitions for 2026\nJudith Schaechter: Super/NaturalOctober
  4\, 2025 – February 8\, 2026Museum of Craft and DesignAn exhibition exp
 loring natural elements\, patterns\,...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://sfmcd.
 org/visit/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-first-thursdays-at-sfs-m
 useum-of-craft-and-design-17/\nSource: Funcheap SF
