 c transit station is Montgomery Station (MUNI & BART)\n\nHoward Stage Happ
 y Hour\nJoin the Howard Stage happy hour every month from 5-7PM at Howard 
 and 2nd St\, featuring house-party vibes in the streets. It's your post-wo
 rk pick-me-up!\n\nPlus... Happy Hour Specials at all outdoor bars from 5-7
