BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:GLIDE Holiday Jam 2026 ft. Patti Labelle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T193000
DTSTAMP:20261106T110227Z
UID:dothebay-17691025@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:GLIDE Holiday Jam 2026\nFeaturing Patti Labelle\n\nThursday\, 
 November 5 | The Warfield\n\nGLIDE is thrilled to announce new details for
  the 2026 GLIDE Holiday Jam: Turn It Up and Turn It Out\, headlined by thr
 ee-time Grammy Award winner\, Rock & Roll Hall of Fame inductee\, and reci
 pient of numerous lifetime achievement honors Patti LaBelle. Returning to 
 The Warfield in San Francisco on Thursday\, November 5\, the GLIDE Holiday
  Jam will also feature powerhouse vocalist Destani Wolf\, traditional Vera
 cruz\, Mexico music group Son de Fandango\, and the legendary GLIDE Ensemb
 le and The Change Band\, led by Zoe Ellis.\n\nFor more than 40 years\, the
  GLIDE Holiday Jam has brought together acclaimed artists\, community lead
 ers\, and supporters for an unforgettable evening of music\, inspiration\,
  and hope while raising critical funds for GLIDE's mission of unconditiona
 l love\, radical inclusion\, and social justice. A beloved Bay Area tradit
 ion\, the GLIDE Holiday Jam is where legendary artists meet everyday heroe
 s\, the spirit of the season shines brightest\, and the community comes to
 gether to support GLIDE's life-changing programs\, including meals\, housi
 ng\, recovery\, health access\, and services for women and families.\n\nPa
 tti LaBelle has captivated audiences for more than six decades with her ex
 traordinary voice\, electrifying stage presence\, and enduring catalog of 
 hits. Known worldwide as the "Godmother of Soul\," she has sold more than 
 50 million records and remains one of the most celebrated and influen...\n
 \n$150\nListed time is doors\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/
 11/5/glide-holiday-jam-2026-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7827039;-122.4103578
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35337292/54ebbe40-9219-4b69-adfb-60399fb4e577.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261106T110227Z
LOCATION:The Warfield\, 982 Market St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/5/glide-holiday-jam-2026-tickets
END:VEVENT
