UID:dothebay-17810263@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Lecture/Education
DESCRIPTION:After Dark: Digest This\nThursday\, November 5 | Exploratorium
 \, Pier 15\n\nGet ready for a sensory and scientific journey tonight\, fol
 lowing everything that happens when—and after—we eat. Explore the surp
 rising historical\, cultural\, and scientific forces that have shaped our 
 meals and pantries. Uncover the connection between your taste buds and olf
 actory receptors\, get to know fermentation microbes\, and enjoy an all-na
 tural menu of music cooked up by DJ Shmunty.\n\nAfter Dark Thursday Nights
 \nThis event is part of our After Dark Thursday Nights series. Unplug and 
 play with 700+ interactive exhibits exploring science\, art\, and percepti
 on. Learn more.\n\n6–10 p.m.\nAdults Only (Ages 18+)\nThe Exploratorium\
 , Pier 15\, San Francisco\n\n18+\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2
 026/11/5/after-dark-digest-this-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.8016649;-122.397348
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35336956/007f439b-6e1a-405a-8a7b-1773fe239cc5.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261106T110227Z
LOCATION:Exploratorium\, Pier 15 \, San Francisco\, CA\, 94111
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/5/after-dark-digest-this-tickets
