BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:After Dark Thursday Nights
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T200000
DTSTAMP:20261030T222920Z
UID:dothebay-17906706@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Arts & Family
DESCRIPTION:After Dark Thursday Nights\n\nEvery Thursday Night | The Explo
 ratorium\, Pier 15\n\nStop scrolling and escape to reality at the Explorat
 orium! Get a little weird with us for evenings worth talking about at Afte
 r Dark Thursday Nights!\n\nRewire your own brain with our weekly explorati
 ons of science\, art\, and culture. Bring your full self and talk to stran
 gers with art lounges\, trivia nights\, dance parties\, surprising experim
 ents\, performances\, demos\, talks\, and more.\n\nMaybe you’ll play lik
 e no one’s watching with 650+ hands-on exhibits. Maybe you’ll let the 
 week go in the total darkness of the Tactile Dome. Grab a drink\, try some
