DESCRIPTION:The Clift Royal Sonesta Hotel is extending its popular Redwood
  Room After Dark entertainment series with two evenings of live jazz each 
 week through December 2026.\nPresented every Thursday and Friday in the le
 gendary Redwood Room\, the expanded calendar will showcase an impressive r
 oster of acclaimed and diverse musicians\, including Sundra Manning\, Gran
 t Levin\, Eamon Flynn\, Glen Pearson\, David Udolf\, and other notable per
 formers.\nCurated with artistic inspiration from Grammy-nominated singer\,
  composer and cultural ambassador Sacha Boutros and founder of Hear Me Roa
 r Entertainment*\, the series brings together world-class musicianship\, t
 imeless cocktails and the unmistakable glamour of one of San Francisco’s
  most storied nightlife destinations. *Hear Me Roar Entertainment promotes
  women\, minorities\, and underrepresented voices in the arts through incl
 usive entertainment\, bespoke cultural programming\, and creative collabor
 ation that foster diversity\, empowerment\, and community connection.\n“
 Live music has always been an important part of the Redwood Room’s ident
 ity\,” said Dania Duke\, General Manager of The Clift Royal Sonesta Hote
 l. “Expanding Redwood Room After Dark to two evenings each week allows u
 s to showcase an extraordinary range of artists while giving San Francisca
 ns and visitors even more opportunities to experience this legendary setti
 ng.”\nNovember Performances:\nNovember 5: Glen Pearson Duo\nNovember 6: 
 Eamonn Flynn\nNovember 12: Sundra Manning Duo\nNovember 13: David Udol...\
 n\nFree\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/5/the-clift-hotel-
 s-legendary-redwood-room-continues-free-live-jazz-programming-tickets\nSou
 rce: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/live-jazz-stor
 ied-1933-redwoodpaneled-lounge-sf/
