DESCRIPTION:Local 500 & Public Works Present\nFunction 500 w/ FLUXIONS\nTh
 ursday\, November 5 | Public Works\n\nThursday\, November 5th\, 9pm - 2am\
 nLoft / 21+ / Limited Capacity\n\nLocal 500 and Public Works Present:\nFun
 ction 500\n\nFor our eighth installment of our monthly residency\, we will
  be local crew and event series organizer\, FLUXIONS (@fluxions.exe). Repr
 esenting FLUXIONS are co-founders Vertigo (@v.ertiig0) & bad juuju (@bad.j
 uuju).\n\nFLUXIONS is bad juuju and Vertigo's event series that curates sw
 eaty\, bassy and foggy DIY focused events in San Francisco\, CA. Launching
  in 2024\, their events and HydeFM residency push soundscapes that mutate 
 in real-time\, weaving between hypnotic atmospheres\, pulsating beats\, an
 d heavily percussive bass lines.\n\nIn true Local500 (@local500sf) fashion
 \, we’re continuing to bring love back to Thursday nights in San Francis
 co. Expect techno\, percussive bass lines\, groove\, and a tighter undergr
 ound feel as we showcase local crews and producers.\n\nLocal500 support: P
 anderer(@panderer.dj) and AGROPOL(@agropol_)\n\nShow up. Support local tal
 ent. Be apart of something...\n\nNovember 5th\n$5 online - $10 at door\n9p
 m-2am\n\nbad juuju: Seamlessly weaving between swirling psychedelic worlds
 \, percussive intensity\, and deep bass frequencies\, bad juuju moves crow
 ds with her eclectic approach rooted in club sensibilities. As a member of
  rising San Francisco-based DJ collective Vitamin1000 and resident on Voic
 es Radio (UK)\, she crafts immersive dancefloor experiences through textur
 al...\n\n$5-$10\, 21+\nLocal 500 & Public Works Present\n\nDetails: https:
 //dothebay.com/events/2026/11/5/local-500-public-works-present-function-50
 0-w-fluxions-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
