 – ’00s music\n10-11 pm: $6 premium cocktails – ’10s music\n11 pm t
 o 2am – Current Hits\n\nUpdated 10/5/21 – Event info last checked via 
 Eventbrite.\n\nMonroe\n\nUpcoming $1 Drink Fridays: “Battle of the Decad
 es” DJ Party (North Beach) Events\nFri 10/9 $1 Drink Fridays: “Battle 
 of the Decades” DJ Party (North Beach)Fri 10/16 $1 Drink Fridays: “Bat
 tle of the Decades” DJ Party (North Beach)Fri 10/23 $1 Drink Fridays: 
