DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening of live salsa with Orquesta La Clave De
 l Blanco. Whether you are a seasoned dancer or\nsimply looking for a livel
 y night out\, come enjoy great music\, dancing\, and the signature Cigar B
 ar atmosphere.\n\nCome early for Pan-Latin cuisine\, craft cocktails\, and
  fine cigars. There is a $20 charge beginning at 9:00 PM\,\nand live music
  starts at 9:30 PM. Guests arriving before 9:00 PM do not need to purchase
  admission online.\n\nSalsa lessons with Ava and Rodolfo begin at 7:00 PM 
 and are paid separately:\n\n$14 in advance or $20 at the door.\n\nVenue: C
 igar Bar & Grill\, 850 Montgomery St.\, San Francisco.\n\nNO REFUNDS - Mus
 t be 21+\n\n$20 beginning at 9:00 PM\nCigar Bar & Grill PRESENTS:\n\nDetai
