DESCRIPTION:DJ Dials\, Titanic's End & 1015 Folsom Present\nMira\nwith Jus
 tin Kan\n\nFriday\, November 6 | 1015 Folsom\n\nDJ Dials\, Titanics End & 
 1015 Folsom Present:\n\nMira\nJKAM\nJustin Kan B2B AMITT\nMETROPOLIS 2050\
 nThe future of dance\n\nFor one night\, step inside METROPOLIS 2050 — a 
 nocturnal nightclub interface where technology\, music\, and humans intera
 ct\, commingle\, and exchange energy on the dance floor.\n\nHeadlined by M
 IRA (Berlin)\, with Justin Kan\, Two very different figures\, two distinct
  musical perspectives\, one night at 1015 Folsom.\n\nBerlin's MIRA brings 
 the depth and atmosphere of the city's underground electronic music cultur
 e\, while San Francisco's Justin Kan represents the intersection of techno
 logy\, creativity\, and the Bay Area's evolving nightlife community.\n\nTo
 gether\, they bridge two cities known for pushing culture forward\, bringi
 ng an unexpected pairing to the 1015 dancefloor.\n\nExpect immersive produ
 ction\, futuristic visuals\, cutting edge dance music\, as we transform th
 e club into a slice of the future. Come get a taste.\n\n10pm • 21+ Only\
 nTable Reservations: BottleService@1015.com\n\n$20-$30\, 21+\nDJ Dials\, T
 itanic's End & 1015 Folsom Present\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events
 /2026/11/6/mira-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
