DESCRIPTION:DJ Dials & 1015 Folsom Present\nMain Phase\nFriday\, November 
 6 | 1015 Folsom\n\nDJ Dials & 1015 Folsom present:\n\nMain Phase\n\nSuppor
 t by: Garage Access\n\nnightware\nbeatriz\ndan frandisco\ndj staley\n\nCop
 enhagen’s Main Phase sits at the intersection of UK garage\, breaks\, gr
 ime and bass\, drawing heavily from the soundsystem-driven club music of t
 he late ’90s and early ’00s without leaning on nostalgia. Alongside In
 terplanetary Criminal\, he’s part of ATW Records\, an imprint closely ti
 ed to the current resurgence of underground UKG.\n\nHis productions are bu
 ilt for the club: swung drums\, heavy low end and stripped-back grooves th
 at move between 2-step\, speed garage and darker bass pressure. His DJ set
 s take the same approach\, moving quickly across UKG\, breaks\, grime\, ju
 ngle and house making the crowd lose it.\n\n10pm • 21+ Only\nTable Reser
 vations: BottleService@1015.com\n\n$25-$37\, 21+\nDJ DIALS & 1015 FOLSOM P
 RESENT\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/6/main-phase-ticket
 s\nSource: DoTheBay
