 et/35274469/8527ee1f-c42b-4e7a-8b29-5f1dad827f18.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261108T061419Z
LOCATION:Telegraph Hill Books\, 1501 Grant Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA\, 9
 4133
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/7/indigenous-voices-greg-sarris-je
 nnifer-foerster-in-conversation-tickets
END:VEVENT
