DESCRIPTION:SF Coffee Festival 2026: Coffee Tastings + Live Music (Nov. 7-
 8)\nCraft Hospitality LLC\n\nCoffee lovers\, your weekend plans are brewin
 g. The 10th annual San Francisco Coffee Festival returns to Fort Mason for
  two days of specialty coffee\, tea\, food\, and live music.\nSample your 
 way through a curated lineup of Bay Area coffee roasters and exhibitors\, 
 discover new beans and flavor profiles\, and chat with the folks behind yo
 ur favorite brews. Curious about what makes a great cup? Ask a master roas
 ter at their booth or sit in on an educational panel.\nBeyond the caffeine
 \, expect live bands\, entertainment\, and plenty of opportunities to find
  your next favorite coffee. Tea drinkers and snack fans can get in on the 
 fun\, too.\n\nWhen: November 7–8\, 2026\nWhere: Festival Pavilion\, Fort
  Mason Center for Arts & Culture\, San Francisco\n\nUpcoming SF Coffee Fes
 tival 2026: Coffee Tastings + Live Music (Nov. 7-8) Events\nSat 11/7 SF Co
 ffee Festival 2026: Coffee Tastings + Live Music (Nov. 7-8)Sun 11/8 SF Cof
 fee Festival 2026: Coffee Tastings + Live Music (Nov. 7-8)Disclaimer: Plea
 se double check event information with the event organizer as events can b
 e canceled\, details can change after they are added to our calendar\, and
  errors do occur.\n\n$29.00\n\nTickets: https://www.sfcoffeefestival.com/\
 nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sf-coffee-festival-2026-coffee-tastings-
 live-music-nov-7-8-2/\nSource: Funcheap SF
