DESCRIPTION:Inner Sunset Flea Market\nThe Big Lunch & Annual Pie Contest\n
 Sunday\, November 8 | 9th - 11th Irving Street | FREE\n\nLaunched in colla
 boration with the Inner Sunset Park Neighbors and happening every second S
 unday from April to November\, this vibrant\, well-loved community event t
 ransforms Irving Street (9th–11th Ave.) into a lively community space an
 d market filled with vintage and secondhand treasures\, artists and makers
 \, community organizations\, and more.\n\nTwo blocks of vendors\, live mus
 ic\, and free family-friendly activities all surrounded by the unique shop
 s and eateries of the Inner Sunset neighborhood. And for the first time\, 
 each market features a unique theme and interactive experiences to make th
 e day even more special.\n\nInner Sunset Flea Market 2026 Season Schedule\
 n\nAPRIL 12th – “Spring Fling Market”\nMAY 10th – “Mother’s Da
 y”\nJUNE 14th – “Celebrating Pride♡”\nJULY 12th – “Garden Pa
 rty”\nAUGUST 9th – “Dog Days of Summer”\nSEPTEMBER 13th – “A T
 aste of Comedy Day”\nOCTOBER 11th – “Tricks\, Treats\, & Treasures
 ”\nNOVEMBER 8th – “The Big Lunch & Annual Pie Contest”\n\nFree\n\n
 Details: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/8/inner-sunset-flea-market-th
 e-big-lunch-annual-pie-contest\nSource: DoTheBay
