  sure to impress your friends and family! Join us on Sunday\, November 8th
  at 1:30pm in the iconic San Francisco Ferry Building for an afternoon of 
 cookie decorating fun! Learn the cookie art basics from baking pros and de
 corate tasty cookie masterpieces of your very own. You will leave class wi
 th a beautifully boxed set of autumn inspired apple cookies perfect for gi
 fting or eating\, plus all the tips\, tricks\, and recipes you need to dec
 orate your own royal icing cookies at home. We will provide all the suppli
 es and you will learn how to pipe and flood with royal icing and how to ad
 d texture and dimension to your cookies. No experience needed!\n\nDetails:
