DESCRIPTION:Super Duper Union Square Grand Opening: Free Bites 2026 (SF)Su
 per Duper Burgers celebrates the opening of its Union Square location with
  free food samples from noon to 12:30 p.m.\, followed by remarks from city
  leaders and a ribbon cutting. The restaurant\, Super Duper’s 24th Bay A
 rea location\, opens to the public after the ceremony.\nWhat will the free
  samples be for Union Square? We don’t know! But earlier this year at th
 e Fillmore location it was the “First 50 in line on opening day get a FR
 EE BURGER!” – so hopefully it’s something similar and substantial.\n
 Original Event Description:\nCity\, Super Duper Burgers to Celebrate Grand
  Opening in Union Square\nWHAT:\nCity officials will celebrate the grand o
 pening of Super Duper Burgers in Union Square\, bringing a beloved local r
 estaurant to the newly renovated café space in the historic plaza. The ce
 lebration will feature free samples\, remarks from city leaders\, and a ri
 bbon cutting. The restaurant will open to the public following the ceremon
 y.\nWHO:\nMayor Daniel Lurie\nSupervisor Danny Sauter\nRecreation and Park
  General Manager Sarah Madland\nSuper Duper Co-founders Adriano Pagini and
  Edmondo Sarti.\nWHEN:\nTuesday\, November 10\, 2026\n\nNoon–12:30 p.m.:
  Free food samples\n12:30 p.m.: Speaking program. Ribbon cutting immediate
 ly following remarks\n\nWHERE:\nUnion Square\, East Café\nStockton Street
  between Post and Geary streets\nSan Francisco\nSUPER DUPER BURGERS OPENS 
 IN UNION SQUARE NOVEMBER 10\nSan Francisco-Born Burger Brand Opens Its 24t
 h Bay...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.toasttab.com/api/service/marketin
 g-campaigns/v1/public/campaigns/139ced37-b9c9-4945-9c02-d9de7b33556c/10087
