DESCRIPTION:It’s a Mission District-themed paint-&-sip experience! Wheth
 er you’re a beginner to lotería\, or whether it’s a staple in your ho
 me\, this KQED Live game night brings a local twist on the beloved Mexican
  game. Start by painting your lotería board\, or tabla\, which features a
  portrait of San Francisco Drag Laureate Per Sia. While you’re painting\
 , enjoy a performance and conversation with Per Sia and Mission Lotería. 
 Then\, we play! Led by Mission Lotería\, the game uncovers the rich histo
 ry of San Francisco’s Mission District.\n\nFeaturing artwork that celebr
 ates the neighborhood’s people\, landmarks\, and traditions\, Mission Lo
 tería invites players to learn while they play. The evening also includes
  a conversation with one of the cultural keepers featured in the deck\, of
 fering stories that bring the cards to life. Come ready to paint\, play\, 
 laugh\, and connect all while learning about the special district many cal
 l home.\n\n$25+\n\nTickets: https://www.kqed.org/event/6827/paint-sip-play
 -a-mission-district-game-night\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/
 11/10/paint-sip-play-a-mission-district-game-night-tickets\nSource: DoTheB
 ay
