 ages its Latinx neighbors to join our audience and dialogue with us.\n\nCu
 rated & Organized by\nCaterina Saddi\nNational Fellow at Arab Film & Media
  Institute\n\nProgram\n\nTeach Me (1996) 5’59”\nAkram Zaatari (b. 1966
 \, Lebanon)\n\nLucía Méndez and the Peace in Lebanon\, (2015—2018) 13
