SUMMARY:Stand-Up Comedy Show: “Secret Sauce Comedy”
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261110T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261110T210000
DTSTAMP:20261111T063824Z
UID:funcheap-1646560@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy Event Types Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerIsrael MedinaGet ready to laug
 h your socks off with some killer stand-up comedy in a chill spot! What’
 s better than comedy\, drinks\, and sandwiches!\nThe equation is simple: Y
 ou + drinks + Bay Area’s top comedians = One hell of a time at The Sandw
 ich Spot.\n\nEase into through your week right at The Sandwich Spot and wa
 tch the Bay Area’s best comics work!\n\nWe’re talking comics who have 
 performed all over the Bay Area at places like:\nSan Francisco Punchline\n
 Cobb’s Comedy Club\nSan Jose Improv\n\nAnd more!\nWhether you’re a com
 edy nerd who knows every Bill Burr special by heart or just someone who ne
 eds a laugh after a long week\, this show delivers.\nGrab your friends\, o
 rder a drink\, and let us do the heavy lifting (of making you laugh).\nDoo
 rs open at 7:00PM. Show starts at 7:30PM.\nDon’t be late – we start on
  time and the first comic always roasts late comers.\nAbout Peninsula Come
 dy:\nPeninsula Comedy is a collective of comedians bringing stand-up to th
 e often-overlooked spots between SF and San Jose. We run shows all through
 out the Peninsula at venues like:\n\nMarvin Gardens in Belmont\nBlue Oak B
 rewing in San Carlos\nAlpha Acid in Belmont\n\nAnd more spots we’re addi
 ng every month!\nOur mission is simple: make the Peninsula a comedy destin
 ation.\nWant to catch our next show?\nFollow us @PeninsulaComedy and @emon
 dismore on Instagram for updates\, lineups\, and more!\nhttps://www.instag
 ram.com/emondismore/\nhttps://www.instagram.com/peninsulacomedy/\n\nFree\n
 \nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/2004571114164?aff=oddtdtcreator\nD
 etails: https://sf.funcheap.com/standup-comedy-show-secret-sauce-comedy-3/
 \nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Secret
 .Sauce_.NOV_.10.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111T063824Z
LOCATION:The Sandwich Spot\, 2420 Broadway\, Redwood City
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/standup-comedy-show-secret-sauce-comedy-3/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Henry: Portrait of a Serial Killer
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261110T194500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261110T214500
DTSTAMP:20261023T171442Z
UID:dothebay-17979566@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:One of the most harrowing films of the 20th century\, HENRY is
  just as much in conversation with SEX\, LIES\, AND VIDEOTAPE as it is wit
 h THE TEXAS CHAIN SAW MASSACRE or DAWN OF THE DEAD. It’s right up there 
 with key works by Haneke\, Cronenberg\, and Noé in its effortless ability
  to push the audience in directions it never thought it’d go. Presaging 
 both our current true-crime obsession and “elevated arthouse horror\,”
  this shockingly audacious debut by John McNaughton (WILD THINGS)\, with i
 ts chilling career-defining turn by Michael Rooker (“The Walking Dead”
 \, GUARDIANS OF THE GALAXY)\, has inspired multiple generations of filmmak
 ers to go for the throat. (AGFA)\n\nNew 4K restoration courtesy of the Ame
 rican Genre Film Archive\n\nTickets: https://drafthouse.com/sf/show/terror
 -tuesday-henry-portrait-of-a-serial-killer?cinemaId=0802&sessionId=22947\n
 Details: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/10/henry-portrait-of-a-serial
 -killer-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
