SUMMARY:Bay Area Elections: What It All Means
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T200000
DTSTAMP:20261111T063824Z
UID:dothebay-18045307@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Lecture/Education
DESCRIPTION:Join journalists from KALW\, Mission Local and the San Francis
 co Standard for an in depth look at the impact of last week's election res
 ults.\n\nConnect with local journalists for an evening of post-election an
 alysis covering the region's most consequential races\, ballot measures\, 
 and political shifts.\n\nJoe Eskenazi of Mission Local and Joe Fitzgerald-
 Rodriguez of the San Francisco Standard join KALW's Ben Trefny for a conve
 rsation about what happened at the polls\, what surprised us\, and what th
 e results reveal about the priorities and perspectives of Bay Area voters.
 \n\nFrom San Francisco's local races and ballot measures to the bigger pol
 itical currents shaping the region\, we'll look beyond the headlines to ma
 ke sense of the outcomes and consider what comes next.\n\nBring your quest
 ions and join the conversation!\n\nJoe Eskenazi\n\nManaging Editor/Columni
 st for Mission Local. Joe was born in San Francisco\, raised in the Bay Ar
 ea\, and attended U.C. Berkeley. He never left. Joe was a writer and colum
 nist for SF Weekly from 2007 to 2015\, and a senior editor at San Francisc
 o Magazine from 2015 to 2017. You may also have read his work in the Guard
 ian (U.S. and U.K.)\; San Francisco Public Press\; San Francisco Chronicle
 \; San Francisco Examiner\; Dallas Morning News\; and elsewhere. He reside
 s in the Excelsior with his wife and three (!) kids\, 4.3 miles from his b
 irthplace and 5\,474 from hers. The Northern California branch of the Soci
 ety of Professional Journalists named Eskenazi the 2019 Jour...\n\nFree\nK
 ALW Public Media\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%
 2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fbay-area-elections-what-it-all-means-tickets-20
 04400355420%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/20
 26/11/11/bay-area-elections-what-it-all-means-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\
 nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/bay-area-elections-means/
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35342773/6dbad9e0-6706-4e37-8b17-e62bb530191f.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111T063824Z
LOCATION:KALW @ 220 Montgomery\, 220 Montgomery St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94104
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/11/bay-area-elections-what-it-all-
