DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerDora TsuiSaison Wine Bar et Sa
 lon will host a special Veterans Day wine tasting on Wednesday\, November 
 11\, from 6–8 PM\, in partnership with VetsinTech.\nThe evening brings t
 ogether four veteran-owned wineries: Lussier Wine Co.\, Rockets Red Wines\
 , Bon Niche Cellars\, and Volatus Wine. Guests will have the opportunity t
 o taste wines\, meet the veterans behind the wineries\, and learn about th
 eir journeys from military service to winemaking.\n\nThe walk-around tasti
 ng will include cheese and charcuterie\, with proceeds from paid tickets b
 enefiting VetsinTech and additional organizations supporting veterans.\nAd
 mission is complimentary for veterans\, who may reserve their tickets by e
 mailing concierge@saisonwinebar.com. General admission is $50 per person t
 hrough OpenTable.\nEvent Details\n\nDate: Wednesday\, November 11\, 2026\n
 Time: 6–8 PM\nVenue: Saison Wine Bar et Salon\nLocation: 228 Townsend St
 reet\, San Francisco\, CA (confirm street number before submission)\nAdmis
 sion: Free for veterans\; $50 for non-veterans\nVeterans’ complimentary 
 tickets: concierge@saisonwinebar.com\n\n$50.00\n\nTickets: https://www.ope
 ntable.com/booking/experiences-availability?rid=1365385&amp\;restref=13653
