BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Interlaced: Textures of History & Transformation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T190000
DTSTAMP:20261111T063824Z
UID:dothebay-18045370@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:The Arts
DESCRIPTION:KALW hosts an artist panel exploring weaving\, beading\, mater
 ial transformation\, and the cultural histories embedded in textile practi
 ces.\n\nWhat can the things we make with our hands tell us about who we ar
 e\, where we come from\, and how we connect with one another?\n\nJoin KALW
  at 220 Montgomery to celebrate Interlaced\, a new exhibition at the Mills
  Building. We'll be in conversation with five of the exhibition's artists 
 — Miguel Arzabe\, Charlene Tan\, Pilar Agüero-Esparza\, Terri Friedman\
 , and Gabby Severson — exploring the ideas\, materials\, and personal hi
 stories woven into their work. From the traditions of weaving and beadwork
  to contemporary approaches to abstraction\, image-making\, and storytelli
 ng\, the conversation will consider how artists use material\, pattern\, a
 nd repetition to explore identity\, memory\, cultural inheritance\, labor\
 , and belonging.\nCome explore the exhibition\, meet the artists\, connect
  with fellow art lovers\, and enjoy an evening of creativity and connectio
 n in the heart of downtown San Francisco.\n\nMiguel Arzabe creates colorfu
 l and dynamic abstractions across weaving\, painting\, and video. He begin
 s by finding outdated beauty in paper ephemera from art exhibitions\, mode
 rnist paintings\, and discarded audio recordings\, which he methodically a
 nalyzes\, deconstructs\, and reverse-engineers. Drawing inspiration from t
 he techniques and motifs of his Andean heritage\, Arzabe weaves these frag
 ments together\, revealing unexpected intersections between form and conte
 nt\,...\n\nFree\nKALW Public Media\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APv
 P5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Finterlaced-textures-of-histor
 y-transformation-tickets-2004171101716%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\nDetails: htt
 ps://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/12/interlaced-textures-of-history-transfo
 rmation-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funchea
 p.com/interlaced-textures-history-transformation-free-joyride-pizza/
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35342861/350d4fd7-d772-4abb-9a5a-d70a95d87dff.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111T063824Z
LOCATION:KALW @ 220 Montgomery\, 220 Montgomery St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94104
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/12/interlaced-textures-of-history-
 transformation-tickets
END:VEVENT
