BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Profs & Pints San Francisco: The World Mount Vesuvius Buried
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T200000
DTSTAMP:20261111T063824Z
UID:dothebay-18023071@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Lecture/Education
DESCRIPTION:Profs and Pints presents: “The World Mount Vesuvius Buried\,
 ” on what we’re learning by the uncovering of ancient Roman towns buri
 ed in volcanic ash\, with Michael Anderson\, a professor of Classical arch
 aeology at San Francisco State University who has spent nearly 30 years st
 udying and excavating Pompeii.\nThe cataclysmic eruption of Mount Vesuvius
  in 79 CE entombed towns\, farms\, and villas in ash and debris\, dooming 
 those around at the time but preserving for future generations a unique an
 d invaluable window onto Roman and Pre-Roman daily life.\nLearn about the 
 fascinating finds of archeologists at work there with Michael Anderson\, d
 irector of the Via Consolare Project excavations of ancient Pompeii\, auth
 or of Space\, Movement and Visibility in Pompeian Houses\, and co-author o
 f House of the Surgeon\, Pompeii: Excavations in the Casa del Chirurgo.\nH
 e’ll discuss how what Vesuvius buried was lost and largely forgotten for
  centuries\, and how the discovery and early excavation of these sites in 
 the eighteenth and nineteenth centuries would transform forever the discip
 lines of art history and archaeology. It also greatly enriched our underst
 anding of ancient Roman daily life\, a process that continues to this day\
 , making Pompeii the longest continuously excavated site in the world.\nEv
 idence from these sites has provided some of the clearest answers to quest
 ions about what life was really like for both the rich and the poor in anc
 ient Italy in Roman times. Dr. Anderson will discuss what...\n\nAdvance: $
 13.50. Door: $17\, or $15 w/ student ID\nProfs and Pints\n\nTickets: https
 ://events.ticketleap.com/tickets/profsandpints/presidio-vesuvius\nDetails:
  https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/12/profs-pints-san-francisco-the-worl
 d-mount-vesuvius-buried-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- ht
 tps://sf.funcheap.com/profs-pints-san-francisco-world-mount-vesuvius-burie
 d/
GEO:37.80353;-122.458967
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111T063824Z
LOCATION:The Dairy at the Presidio Sports Basement\, 610 Old Mason Street\
 , San Francisco\, CA\, 94129
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/12/profs-pints-san-francisco-the-w
 orld-mount-vesuvius-buried-tickets
END:VEVENT
