 world to local audiences. The group has commissioned more than 120 new wor
 ks\, by emerging as well as established composers. Attending a Volti conce
 rt is like visiting a modern art gallery\, stimulating the mind\, the imag
 ination and the heart.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://lcalive.org/public/even
