CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:Image from the Arab Film FestivalAn Evening of Love and Laught
 er: Arab Cinema Under the Stars\nA FREE Outdoor Screening at The PROXY\, H
 ayes Valley Neighborhood\, San Francisco\nFor the first time ever\, the Ar
 ab Film Festival celebrates its 30 year anniversary by taking cinema outdo
 ors! Join us under the stars for Spices and Lies (La Petite Cuisine de Meh
 di)\, directed by Amine Adjina\, and starring Hiam Abbas\, a delightful Fr
 ench-Algerian romantic comedy served with love\, laughter\, family dynamic
 s\, cultural identity\, and\, of course\, food. Who can miss that!\n\nThis
  screening is co-presented by Alliance Française de San Francisco\, and c
 o-sponsored by SAJJ Mediterranean\, Bi-Rite Family of Businesses\, KAYMA A
 lgerian Eatery\, la Mediterranee\, Drink Palestina\, Lotus Falafel & Shawe
 rma\, and Picturelock.\nImagine the magic of a European film festival\, th
 ink Piazza Grande at the Locarno Film Festival in Switzerland\; or the Tri
 beca Film Festival in New York with their outdoor screening at the Hudson 
 Yards\, where cinema brings people together under the night sky. Now exper
 ience that magic right here in the heart of Hayes Valley in San Francisco!
 \nBring your friends\, your colleagues and your family and find your spot\
 , and enjoy an evening of a foreign film\, delicious street food\, and sha
 red laughter with love.\nWe’re thrilled to welcome KAYMA Eatery as our c
 o-sponsor and featured food booth. KAYMA will be serving up warm\, delicio
 us Algerian dishes available for purchase\, adding a cozy touch to the...\
 n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://aff30.arabfilmfestival.org/events#under-the-st
 ars\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-arab-film-festival-outdoor-movi
 e-night-proxy-hayes-valley/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AFF-20
 26-Official-Selections-Features.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261110T072652Z
LOCATION:Proxy SF\, 432 Octavia St San Francisco\, CA 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-arab-film-festival-outdoor-movie-night-pr
 oxy-hayes-valley/
END:VEVENT
