BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tom Djll\, Tanukispidercat\, Hat Brackets\, Under The Skin
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T230000
DTSTAMP:20261111T063824Z
UID:funcheap-1642691@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerTom Djll\nNewly returned from 
 an east coast tour\, Djll’s well honed edge is now obsidian-sharp and gl
 eaming with a ghostly hue that is only achieved through deep practice. Kna
 pping slabs of sound he then sets them in phrases and etches each using ti
 mbres from his bag of synth circuits\, trumpet and touch to uncover realia
  and relics from futures as yet unpassed. Close your eyes to see your poss
 ible selves unearthed\, scraped and feather dusted\, then entreated to sel
 f assemble in the anthropoid menagerie of vibration.\nhttps://djll.bandcam
 p.com/\nTanukispidercat\nBy dissecting sound into pieces and manipulating 
 these fragments in real-time\, she sculpts an ever-evolving and fluid soun
 dscape. Layering\, laughing wildly\, and staggering ever forwards. To disc
 overing the Tanukispidercat in its preferred habitat is to behold a fragme
 nted\, unlikely and chimerical animal endemic to San Francisco. With as ma
 ny fangs as bright yellow eyes\, from crouch to pounce\, her blizzard of t
 ooth\, claw\, fluff\, synth and sampler come full fury with lethal-swift p
 addycakes of pure desire.\nhttps://www.tanukispidercat.com/\n\nHat Bracket
 s\nWell-feared as latenight KALX & KPFA broadcast artist The Genderwave an
 d well-remembered as former member of the Forever Oscillating Gaseous Corp
 sewater\, Ky Nyza’s solo sound is yet another world of immeasurable worl
 ds within worlds. Whether you find there a bottomless spring or an infinit
 e pit depends on how deeply you dare to dive. On this nigh...\n\n$5.00\n\n
 Tickets: https://www.facebook.com/events/2103084627264120/\nDetails: https
 ://sf.funcheap.com/tom-djll-tanukispidercat-hat-brackets-skin/\nSource: Fu
 ncheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Nov12_
 2026_web.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111T063824Z
LOCATION:Peacock Lounge\, 552 Haight St\, San Francisco\, CA 94117
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/tom-djll-tanukispidercat-hat-brackets-skin/
END:VEVENT
