CATEGORIES:Variety
DESCRIPTION:Into The Streets & Non Stop Bhangra Present\nThird Annual Offi
 cial City and County of San Francisco Diwali Celebration\nBhangra & Beats 
 Night Market\nFriday\, November 13 | Yerba Buena Gardens\n\nBhangra & Beat
 s returns to Yerba Buena Gardens for a special Diwali edition. Join us for
  an unforgettable evening as Yerba Buena Gardens\, Jessie Square\, and Yer
 ba Buena Lane glow with the vibrant sights\, sounds\, flavors\, and spirit
  of South Asian culture as we celebrate Diwali\, the Festival of Lights.\n
 \nAt the heart of it all is the joyful Bhangra & Beats experience—a fami
 ly-friendly celebration where traditional Punjabi rhythms meet Bay Area en
 ergy. Non Stop Bhangra will once again lead the festivities with its signa
 ture mix of interactive dance lessons\, vibrant performances\, live dhol d
 rumming\, DJs\, and an open dance floor\, alongside a lively night market 
 featuring local food vendors\, artisans\, community activations\, family-f
 riendly activities\, and special offerings from neighborhood restaurants a
 nd bars.\n\nDiwali celebrates light over darkness\, hope\, renewal\, and t
 he triumph of good over evil. Whether you're celebrating with family and f
 riends or experiencing the Festival of Lights for the first time\, everyon
 e is welcome to come dance\, connect\, and celebrate together in the heart
  of San Francisco.\n\nPresented by Into The Streets and Non Stop Bhangra\,
  in partnership with Yerba Buena Partnership\, the Mayor's Office of Danie
 l Lurie\, the San Francisco Office of Economic and Workforce Developme...\
 n\nFree\nInto The Streets & Non Stop Bhangra Present: Third Annual Officia
 l City and County of San Francisco Diwali Celebration\n\nTickets: https://
 bb-diwali-26.eventbrite.com\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/
 13/bhangra-beats-night-market-official-city-of-sf-diwali-tickets\nSource: 
 DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/bhangra-beats-night
 -market-sfs-official-diwali-celebration-yerba-buena-gardens/
