DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer“To Stay\, To Stay\, To Stay
  is about the great contradiction of love\, that it brings both great baff
 lement and great clarity\, and somehow\, ultimately\, isn’t a contradict
 ion. So much hard-earned daily wisdom here. I needed this book. You probab
 ly do too.”—Peter Orner\, author of The Gossip Columnist’s Daughter\
 nDevon will be joined in conversation by Daniel Gumbiner\, the author of F
 ire in the Canyon.\n****\nABOUT THIS EVENT\n\nThis event will be hosted by
  Book Passage at our Corte Madera store.\nFree Admission / Open Seating\nI
 f you are unable to attend the event\, you can still get your copy by clic
 king the “BUY THE BOOK” button above. If you would like a signed or pe
 rsonalized book\, please note that in the order comment field.\nThere will
  be a signing line or meet-and-greet following the presentation.\nPlease c
 ontact books@bookpassage.com with questions regarding events.\n\nFree\n\nT
 ickets: https://bookpassage.com/event/devon-halliday-stay-stay-stay\nDetai
 ls: https://sf.funcheap.com/devon-halliday-daniel-gumbiner-stay-stay-stay/
