DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special night celebrating some of the Bay Area
 ’s funniest comedic talent as they deliver the jokes you won’t want to
  miss.\n\nMore Info: https://linktr.ee/UIUBayArea\nBig laughs. Zero ego.\n
 Get ready for a night of unforgettable laughs at Ego Check – The Bay Are
 a Comedy Showcase! Join us Friday\, November 13\, for a special night cele
 brating some of the Bay Area’s funniest comedic talent as they take the 
 stage to deliver the jokes\, stories\, and punchlines you won’t want to 
 miss.\nHosted at the stylish 620 Jones Cocktail Bar & Restaurant in San Fr
 ancisco\, this upscale nightlife experience brings together comedy\, cockt
 ails\, and great company for one memorable Friday night.\nWhether you’re
  a comedy enthusiast\, looking for a unique night out\, or simply ready to
  laugh until your ribs hurt\, this is the place to be. Grab a drink\, brin
 g your friends\, meet someone new\, and get ready for an evening full of b
 ig laughs and good vibes.\nLeave the ego at the door. Bring your sense of 
 humor.\nCome out\, show love to rising comedic talent\, and experience Ego
  Check for yourself!\n\nPublished by 620 Jones\nContains information from 
 CalDiscovery (caldiscovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://620-jones.c
 om/calendar/uiu-bay-area-comedy-night/?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=
 ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
