DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerSF’s HellaSecret “Crazy Fu
 nny Asians” Friday Night Comedy Showcase (7p + 9p)\nHellaFunny\nInspired
  by the blockbuster movie\, see some of the Bay Area’s top comedians at 
