 and waitstaff\n\nLike all things in life\, the comedy lineup is subject to
  change.\n———-\n$20 TIX AVAILABLE (50) AT DOOR – When Advanced Tix
  are sold out\n\nAbout The Function\nIntroducing The Function\, a vibrant 
 addition to the city’s entertainment scene\, where laughter reigns supre
 me and every night is a celebration of come...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https:/
 /www.eventbrite.com/e/rush-hour-comedy-night-w-sfs-best-black-asian-stand-
