SUMMARY:Neil Young Celebration: Rust Never Sleeps & more
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T213000
DTSTAMP:20261109T222818Z
UID:dothebay-18052793@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Neil Young Birthday Celebration:\n\nLive Tribute Set & screeni
 ng of Rust Never Sleeps\n\nSinger/songwriter Neil Young is sometimes visio
 nary\, sometimes flaky\, sometimes both at once\, but he has never been bo
 ring. Indeed\, Neil Young has weathered runs of critical and popular ambiv
 alence only to be vindicated by being periodically "rediscovered" by young
  musicians and fans. He has maintained a large following since the early '
 70s with music in three basic styles solo acoustic ballads\, sweet country
  rock\, and lumbering garage rock (with some experimental music side trips
 )\, all topped by his high voice and he veers from one to another in unpre
 dictable phases. His subject matter also shifts from personal confessions 
 to allusive stories to bouncy throwaways. A dedicated primitivist\, Young 
 is constantly proving that simplicity is not always simple.\n\nRust Never 
 Sleeps is a concert film shot on Neil Young's 1978 U.S. tour\, filmed at t
 he Cow Palace in San Francisco. Divided into two segments\, acoustic and e
 lectric\, the film is Young at his best\, shown just why the grunge genera
 tion holds him in such high esteem\, and that not all 60's heroes were bur
 nt out by the mid-70's.\n\nMUSIC at 7:30 PM\n\nFILM at 8:15 PM\n\nTickets:
  https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/20292?siteToken=d2atbcege5knq
 savntt91g1250\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/13/neil-young-
 celebration-rust-never-sleeps-more-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.782364;-122.482951
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35372254/564a8891-3733-4d20-8fb7-f40c97cb6f56.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109T222818Z
LOCATION:Cinema SF\, 2200 Clement Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94121 \, San
  Francisco\, CA\, 94117
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/13/neil-young-celebration-rust-nev
 er-sleeps-more-tickets
END:VEVENT
