BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:“It’s Raining Queens”
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T220000
DTSTAMP:20261104T195100Z
UID:dothebay-18011025@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Variety
DESCRIPTION:A powerhouse evening of music\, comedy and storytelling arrive
 s this fall as legendary vocalist Martha Wash and comedian and actress Mar
 sha Warfield unite for It’s Raining Queens at Feinstein’s at the Nikko
  on November 13.\n\nFor both performers\, the engagement marks a meaningfu
 l homecoming to the city tied to the early chapters of their careers.\n\nM
 artha Wash was born and raised in San Francisco\, where her journey began.
  She first gained recognition singing alongside Sylvester as one half of T
 wo Tons O’ Fun before achieving international success with The Weather G
 irls. A two-time Grammy nominee\, Wash is the voice behind multi-platinum 
 recordings with The Weather Girls\, Black Box and C+C Music Factory\, a ca
 talog that shaped dance floors and pop radio around the world and continue
 s to inspire new generations.\n\nWarfield’s San Francisco connection dat
 es to a pivotal breakthrough. In 1979\, she won the San Francisco Internat
 ional Comedy Competition\, becoming the contest’s first Black winner and
  its first female winner. She went on to write and perform for Richard Pry
 or’s groundbreaking variety series The Richard Pryor Show before buildin
 g her own reputation on sharp\, unhurried wit. An Emmy and NAACP Image Awa
 rd nominee\, she is best known for Night Court and has since appeared on T
 he Upshaws and 9-1-1.\n\nNow\, the two trailblazers join forces for It’s
  Raining Queens\, a variety show filled with live music\, comedy and candi
 d stories drawn from two extraordinary careers.\n\nPresented by Do-Kw...\n
 \n$54\nDo-Kwa Productions Presents\n\nTickets: https://www.feinsteinssf.co
 m/tm-event/its-raining-queens-martha-wash-and-marsha-warfield/\nDetails: h
 ttps://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/13/it-s-raining-queens-in-san-francisco
 -tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.786008;-122.409296
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35202008/f8cb9bf2-72ac-4d71-8704-3c392d6730f6.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261104T195100Z
LOCATION:Feinstein's at the Nikko(San Francisco)\, 222 Mason Street\, San 
 Francisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/13/it-s-raining-queens-in-san-fran
 cisco-tickets
END:VEVENT
