BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Performing Arts Showcase (Canceled due to weather)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T010000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T040000
DTSTAMP:20261112T004845Z
UID:caldiscovery-festival-3596af29cef2fb62@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:6
CATEGORIES:dance,festival,holiday,music,theater
DESCRIPTION:UPDATE: Due to rain\, this event has been canceled. We will re
 schedule the Performing Arts Showcase for a future date.\nOriginal: On Fri
 day\, November 13\, from 5–8 pm\, Fulton Plaza will come alive beneath t
 he dazzling SPECTRA lights for the holiday season’s Performing Arts Show
 case\, a celebration bringing together some of downtown’s most exciting 
 performing arts organizations for one unforgettable evening.\nGuests will 
 be treated to a dynamic lineup of live performances of what’s on stage F
 all 2026-Winter 2027. Expect short works from the San Francisco Opera\, Sa
 n Francisco Ballet musicians\, San Francisco Conservatory of Music\, the A
 frican American Shakespeare Company\, RAWdance\, and more. From powerful v
 oices and sweeping orchestral music to captivating movement and theatrical
  performances\, the showcase offers a little bit of everything — and is 
 a memorable way to launch the holiday season.\nThis event is free\, RSVP h
 ere. There will be both bleacher and street-level seating.\nAfter the perf
 ormances there opportunity to mingle with the performing arts organization
 s along with the SF Symphony and ATG San Francisco\, as well as ticket sal
 es\, ticket raffles\, and bites and drinks for purchase.\n\nThank you to e
 vent sponsors: Avenue Greenlight\, Civic Center Community Benefit District
 \, Illuminate\, and the San Francisco Public Library\n\nPublished by SF Ci
 vic Center\nContains information from CalDiscovery (caldiscovery.com)\, OD
 bL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://sfciviccenter.org/event/holiday-season-performi
 ng-arts-showcase/?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-
 francisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
LAST-MODIFIED:20261112T004845Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sfciviccenter.org/event/holiday-season-performing-arts-showcas
 e/?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
END:VEVENT
