DESCRIPTION:Epic GamesJoin the 2026 Epic AI MegaJam in person in San Franc
 isco. Build a playable game in Unreal Engine or UEFN with up to four teamm
 ates\nSpend the final weekend of the 2026 Epic AI MegaJam building in pers
 on at Digital Jungle in San Francisco\, November 14–15. You’ll jam alo
 ngside teams from Anthropic\, Google\, Meshy\, OpenAI\, and SpaceXSI.\nTea
 m up with up to four other humans and unlimited agents to build a playable
  game in Unreal Engine or Unreal Editor for Fortnite (UEFN)\, and compete 
 for cash prizes.\n\nBring AI into your workflow\, from asset generation to
  coding agents. Prototype the mechanic you never had time for\, or try the
  art style you weren’t sure you could pull off.\nThe jam kicks off onlin
 e on November 12\, so you can start building early and bring your project 
 with you.\nTo jam in person\, you need both:\n– An Eventbrite ticket for
  venue access\n– A registration on the 2026 Epic AI MegaJam itch.io page
  to submit your game\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/2026
 -epic-ai-megajam-in-person-event-tickets-2003723451783\nDetails: https://s
