BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Outdoor Painting Meetup Overlooking the Painted Ladies (Alamo
  Square)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T120000
DTSTAMP:20261111T063824Z
UID:funcheap-1644991@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:©Out There Watercolors\, 2026Free outdoor painting gathering 
 at Alamo Square. Come paint with us! Sign up at Painters Unite to hear abo
 ut future gatherings.\nPainters Unite is a free monthly gathering for anyo
 ne who wants to slow down and paint outdoors\, together. No class\, no pre
 ssure\, nothing for sale.\nI’m Marco Flavio\, a watercolor teacher here 
 in the city. I started this because so many people told me they wanted mor
 e time to paint and to be around others\, and I think that shouldn’t hav
 e to cost anything. I’ll be painting right alongside you\, same as every
 one.\n\nThis month we’re meeting at Alamo Square Park\, by the picnic ta
 bles overlooking the Painted Ladies\, at 10 AM. From there we’ll have a 
 wonderful view of the colorful Victorian houses with the San Francisco sky
 line rising behind them. It’s a great opportunity to play with architect
 ure\, perspective\, color\, and the contrast between old and new San Franc
 isco.\nAs always\, I’ll bring a few small challenges\, different ways of
  seeing and painting what’s in front of us. I’ll also have a limited n
 umber of pre-drawings of the Painted Ladies on watercolor paper\, first co
 me\, first served\, for beginners who’d like a starting point. Take a ch
 allenge\, use a pre-draw\, or simply find a spot and paint. No experience 
 needed.\nBring a sketchbook and something to draw or paint with. If you ha
 ve a watercolor kit\, bring it. A folding or camping chair is welcome\, or
  a mat or blanket to sit on. Anything that makes it comfortable to settle 
 in for...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.outtherewatercolors.com/painters
 -unite\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-outdoor-painting-meetup-over
 looking-painted-ladies-alamo-square/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_92
 49.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111T063824Z
LOCATION:Alamo Square Park\, Scott St. & Fulton St.\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-outdoor-painting-meetup-overlooking-paint
 ed-ladies-alamo-square/
END:VEVENT
