 \nJoin us on Saturday\, November 14\, from 1–4 PM\, for a special Silent
  Art Auction featuring original paintings by Victoria Lashkareff\, a Russi
 an émigré artist whose work was exhibited throughout Northern California
 .\n\nWith starting bids at just $50\, this is your chance to find a one-of
 -a-kind piece for your home or a memorable holiday gift.\n\nEnjoy a wine a
 nd cheese reception featuring Beaulieu Vineyard\, whose legendary winemake
 r André Tchelistcheff was also a Russian émigré.\n\nCome for the art\, 
 stay for the wine\, and support San Francisco's cultural heritage!\n\nTick
 ets & Online Gallery\n\n$10.00\n\nTickets: https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/tic
 keting/silent-auction-victoria-lashkareff-paintings\nDetails: https://doth
 ebay.com/events/2026/11/14/silent-art-auction-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
