DESCRIPTION:The Drawing Room\nWe figure that everyone could use a little w
 onder\, beauty and magic in our lives right now. So The Drawing Room is th
 rilled to announce WONDERLAND: a light\, airy\, weird and wonderful exhibi
 tion!\nJoin us Saturday\, November 14th to celebrate the opening night of 
 WONDERLAND. This exhibition explores whimsy\, fantastical Edens\, and imag
 ined universes\, and highlights the wonderlands that already exist around 
 us. 100 local artists are represented in this awe-filled show spanning a v
 ariety of mediums from painting to mosaics to salvaged furniture. Support 
 your local arts community\, meet the creatives around you\, and (hopefully
 ) take home a wonderful hand-made work of art!\n\nExpect refreshments\, mu
 sic\, and fun. Saturday\, November 14th\, 4-9pm at 599 Valencia Street!\n\
 nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/wonderland-opening-receptio
 n-a-new-exhibition-the-drawing-room-tickets-2003845731525\nDetails: https:
