BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Larisa Brechun: Somnia Opening Reception
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T190000
DTSTAMP:20261104T195100Z
UID:dothebay-18019968@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Arts & Family
DESCRIPTION:Larisa Brechun: Somnia\nOpening Reception with the artist 5–
 9 PM\n\nThe subtle qualities of the soul—softness\, stillness\, fragilit
 y\, solitude—are often belittled for their “weakness\," dismissed as d
 efects of simpering prey in a predatory age\, where might and volume rule 
 and humanity fills its hours with chatter and self-exposure. Introspection
  is the enemy of the social machine\, softness a death sentence\, silence 
 a grave. And yet\, these delicate instincts are essential to the most inti
 mate operation of the soul: the dream.\n\nIn Larisa Brechuns’s Somnia\, 
 the artist lays bare the quiet privacy of the dreaming mind and the fugiti
 ve debris of memory\, myth\, and imagination as it freely floats in the co
 coon of sleep\, coalescing into mysterious forms that defy daylight logic.
  Under her gentle hand\, soft animal bodies take shape alongside evaporati
 ng cosmic beings and primordial symbols of wilderness\, all adrift in the 
 penumbra of the dreaming state\, suspended in etheric margins between the 
 deep woodland dark and the flirting light of a winking moon.\n\nBrechun’
 s darkness has substance\, an amplitude of unseen marrow with texture and 
 weight\, like a cave or a chrysalis. Lonely figures gently emerge from aby
 ssal thickets\, twisting into the light of the omnipresent moon’s awaren
 ess as quickly as they recede. They are camouflaged by silence and shadow\
 , hiding by turns in shyness\, in stillness\, in pain\, in contemplation\,
  their bodies alternating between states of rest and transmutation. The pa
 in...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.ryangraffcontemporary.com/larisabrec
 hun\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/14/larisa-brechun-somnia
 -opening-reception-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.788704;-122.4138
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35238544/7918f20d-8d87-4e49-a08a-5b2e6ad530f7.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261104T195100Z
LOCATION:Ryan Graff Contemporary\, 804 Sutter Street\, San Francisco\, CA\
 , 94109
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/14/larisa-brechun-somnia-opening-r
 eception-tickets
END:VEVENT
