DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerRed Oak Victory’s final Swin
 g Dance for 2026 will take place on November 14 and we will welcome the re
 turn to the ship of very popular Bay Area performers\, the Alpha Rhythm Ki
 ngs. We will be serving beer\, wine\, and cocktails (for those over 21\, o
 f course) in our Tiki Bar Lounge. If you get hungry\, we’ll have hotdogs
  and other snacks available for purchase from the ship’s galley. And if 
 you get tired of dancing\, take a tour of our historic\, World War II ship
 . We encourage and appreciate swing dancers in vintage clothing. But if yo
 u’re not a dancer or you’re not into vintage clothing you are just as 
 welcome and there’s plenty to do. Enjoy the music\, have a couple drinks
 \, enjoy some snacks\, and take a tour of our World War II ship. Maybe you
  want to learn a couple swing dance moves? Well\, then\, at 6:30 we’ll g
 et you started with the instructors from Richmond’s Hidden City Ballroom
  conducting basic swing dance lessons. A $25 Advance Ticket ($10 for kids 
 12 and under)\, includes admission to the ship and dancing to the Alpha Rh
 ythm King’s music. Beer\, wine\, and cocktails (21 and over only)\, and 
 hotdogs\, snacks and soft drinks will be available for purchase. A self-gu
 ided tour of the ship is also included in the price. NOTE: The $25 Advance
  TIcket is only available through Saturday\, November 7. After that\, onli
 ne tickets will be $30 for adults and $15 for children 12 and under. If we
  are not sold out\, these prices also apply to tickets purchased at th...\
 n\n$12.51\n\nTickets: https://go.airhorn.events/r/9eyGyO\nDetails: https:/
 /sf.funcheap.com/2026-fall-fling-swing-dance-wwii-ship-richmond/\nSource: 
 Funcheap SF
