DESCRIPTION:Born from RASA’s Eiffel Tower show in Paris\, MONUMENTS tran
 sforms extraordinary landmarks into singular nights of music\, atmosphere\
 , and connection. For one night\, the architecture becomes part of the exp
 erience. San Francisco’s Palace of Fine Arts is next.\n\nMONUMENTS is RA
 SA’s new event series bringing music into some of the world’s most rem
 arkable spaces. Each edition is shaped by its setting\, pairing iconic arc
 hitecture with carefully curated artists\, immersive production\, and the 
 community around it.\n\nThe idea is simple: take a place people already kn
 ow and create a night they’ve never experienced there before.\n\n21+\, t
 ickets starting at $50\nPRESENTED BY RASA X NPU\n\nTickets: https://rasa.f
 yi/event/monuments/igbio\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/14/
