DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerEmon Dismore“Stand-Up @The G
 arden” is the newest & hottest comedy show in the Peninsula and it takes
  place at Marvin Gardens on Saturday\, November 14th. Marvin Gardens is a 
 true Hidden Gem of the Peninsula. It’s a gorgeous venue that provides th
