DESCRIPTION:The blurb is: hahahahahahahahahaha hahahahahahaha hihihi hahah
 ahahahaha hoho hahahhahaha hehe hahahahahahahahahaha.\n\nPart clowning\, p
 art surreal social experiment\, part connection-forging alchemy\, Julia Ma
 sli’s award-winning solo phenomenon ha ha ha ha ha ha ha (a New York Tim
 es Top Pick of the Year) arrives in San Francisco for two weeks following 
 a string of critically acclaimed runs across the USA and Europe.\n\nPerfor
 mer Julia Masli creates a hilarious\, yet moving and unpredictable live ex
 perience at the intersection of comedy and performance. What begins as pla
 yful improvisation evolves into a collective ritual of care\, vulnerabilit
 y\, and unexpected humor. Masli explores the subtle boundary between a lau
 gh and a tear\, proving that one lies very close to the other.\n\nThe Guar
 dian says ha ha ha ha ha ha ha is “a great unexpected carnival of mutual
  care\, ring-led with a featherlight touch by a clown whose mischief is ma
 tched only by her compassion.”\n\nUtterly unlike anything else onstage\,
  this is a completely different experience every night that keeps audience
 s coming back again and again.\n\n$25-$65\nThe Umbrella Theater presents  
 A Woolly Mammoth Theatre Company Touring Production\n\nTickets: https://ti
 ckets.umbrellasf.org/events/theumbrellatheater/2430729\nDetails: https://d
 othebay.com/events/2026/11/14/ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-tickets\nSource: DoTheB
 ay
LAST-MODIFIED:20261110T072652Z
LOCATION:Theater 33\, 533 Sutter Street\, Upstairs\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/14/ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-tickets
END:VEVENT
