UID:funcheap-1645908@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerClarion Performing Arts Center
 PLEASE READ BEFORE YOU SIGN UP TO PERFORM:\n1) Clarion’s Music Open Mic 
 and Talent Show entertains a specific audience that enjoys pop and classic
 al songs and music\, a little humor\, and dances like hula and jazz. While
  we welcome artists of other genres\, the host has the authority to “gon
 g” down any inappropriate act for the audience\; therefore\, please prep
 are clean versions of your act.\n\n2) Starting August 2025\, the Performan
 ce fee to Open Mic on the website is $5.\nThank you for your attention to 
 this matter.\n\nBay Area soulful singer Khalia returns to Clarion Performi
 ng Arts Center as the monthly open mic host — a full-circle moment at th
 e very space where her music journey began. As the first open mic she ever
  attended\, Clarion helped shape Khalia into the artist she is today. With
  a focus on connection\, encouragement\, and community\, she’s excited t
 o help spotlight local musicians and continue cultivating an inclusive\, u
 plifting space for artists of all levels.\n\nThe event will be live-stream
 ed on our YouTube Channel.\n\nBring your music and put on your dancing sho
 es! It’s time to share your talents with a group of friends!\n\nNo-judge
 ment\, supportive environment\, but keep it family-friendly.\n\nAlways wit
 h complimentary tea and snacks 🙂\n\nCheck out highlights of previous Op
 en Mics:\nInstagram Reel 1\nInstagram Reel 2\n\nParking Tip:\n$8 all-day p
 arking at St. Mary’s Square Garage\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.thecl
 arionsf.org/events/open-mic-singer-songwriters-hosted-by-khalia-2\nDetails
 : https://sf.funcheap.com/free-monthly-singersongwriter-open-mic-khalia-sf
 /\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Openmi
 cNOVer.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111T063824Z
LOCATION:Clarion Performing Arts Center\, 2 Waverly Pl\, San Francisco\, C
 A
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-monthly-singersongwriter-open-mic-khalia-
 sf/
END:VEVENT
