CATEGORIES:Lecture/Education
DESCRIPTION:A night of listening & conversation with Lou Cornum\, Signal H
 ill & The Kitchen Sisters overlooking Downtown SF at Warfield Commons from
  KALW\n\nOn November 19th\, 1969\, two American astronauts set foot on the
  moon. The next day\, eighty American Indians landed on Alcatraz Island.\n
 \nJoin us for a live presentation of "On Another Rock\," a feature length 
 audio essay written and reported by Lou Cornum\, produced and sound design
 ed by Jackson Roach for Signal Hill.\n\nHear this compelling\, sound rich 
 story in full\, accompanied by a conversation with Cornum\, Nikki Silva of
  the Kitchen Sisters\, and Jackson Roach of Signal Hill. Live\, overlookin
 g Downtown San Francisco from the top of the Warfield Commons\, at KALW.\n
 \nLou Cornum is a writer\, editor\, and professor living in New York City.
  They are an enrolled member of the Navajo Nation.\n\nNikki Silva\, one ha
 lf of The Kitchen Sisters\, with her radio partner Davia Nelson\, has prod
 uced hundreds of stories for NPR\, and for the award winning podcast The K
 itchen Sisters Present. Their work includes the Peabody Award-winning NPR 
 series Lost & Found Sound and The Sonic Memorial\, The James Beard Award w
 inning series Hidden Kitchens\, Hidden World of Girls and more. Their late
 st series\, The Keepers\, chronicles activist archivists\, rogue librarian
 s\, curators\, historians\, collectors—guardians of culture\, history an
 d the free flow of information. Their four decades of recordings and archi
 ves have been acquired by the Library of Congress.\n\nSignal Hill is an a.
 ..\n\nFree\nKALW Public Media\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u
 =https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fsignal-hill-on-another-rock-ticket
 s-2003998692034%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/event
 s/2026/11/15/signal-hill-on-another-rock-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35342992/ce27bc21-d5bc-4cf4-80c9-3bf71c23121a.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261106T013613Z
LOCATION:KALW @ 220 Montgomery\, 220 Montgomery St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94104
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/15/signal-hill-on-another-rock-tic
 kets
END:VEVENT
