UID:dothebay-17909199@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:The London-based\, BRIT Award-winning singer\, songwriter\, ac
 tor and activist KATE NASH has seen it all\, from finding huge commercial 
