 sClip\, and a special guest from one of the Bay Area’s top fintech brand
 s. They’ll get real about how AI is changing short-form: what’s workin
 g\, what’s hype\, and how lean teams are shipping more without burning o
 ut. Then stick around to swap notes with social\, video and content folks 
 who get your job. Nobody here will ask you to explain what a hook is.\n\nA
 lso on the menu:\nFree clips: Drop us a link to a webinar\, podcast or tal
 k\, and we’ll send back ready-to-post clips within 24 hours.\nWin Ray-Ba
 n Meta glasses in our end-of-night raffle.\nNo pitch. Just good drinks and
  better conversations.\n\nWho should come: social media managers\, video p
 roducers\, content marketers\, and community and field marketers at Bay Ar
 ea tech and finance companies. ICs and team leads welcome. Bring a teammat
