DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerOverview\n\nQueer Bowling MBC\
 n\nPride may only be once a year\, but Queer Bowling is at MBC every month
 ! Join us on the third Monday of each month to support our community and r
 aise awareness of local non-profits fighting the good fight. Complimentary
  bowling is sponsored by select brands who support LGBTQIA+. Purchasing a 
 ticket in advance guarantees you entry to MBC and for every ticket purchas
 ed we will donate $10 to support a local non-profit of our choosing.\n\nIn
  2025\, with your help we raised $8k and supported the following organizat
 ions: Drag Story Hour\, Mujeres Unidas y Activas\, San Francisco AIDS Foun
 dation\, Vanguard Lab\, Lyric Center for LGBTQQ+ Youth\, SF Black Pride\, 
 Oaklash\, Sí a la Vida\, Bay Area American Indian Two-Spirits\, & more!\n
 Your ticket purchase also gets you a complimentary drink (welcome cocktail
 ) as our way of saying thank you for your support of MBC and our community
 .\nHow it works:\n+ Purchasing a ticket will guarantee you entry to the bo
 wling alley & you will receive a complimentary drink ticket for the welcom
 e drink (both alcoholic and non-alcoholic options available)\n+ You will c
 heck-in with staff to place your name on the bowling list\n+ When we are r
 eady for you\, you will be placed with your group or other guests to bowl 
 on a lane\n+ Bowling is FREE! Each month\, bowling is sponsored by select 
 spirits\, and Standard Deviant Brewing!\n+ Each lane bowls for 5 frames (y
 ou have the opportunity to place your name back on the list...\n\n$14.36\n
 \nTickets: https://go.airhorn.events/r/2eRB3e\nDetails: https://sf.funchea
 p.com/queer-bowling-mbc/\nSource: Funcheap SF
