DESCRIPTION:What: Found Company\nWhere: Eclectic Box (map)\nWhen: November
  16\, 2026 at 7:00 PM\nTickets\n\nYou are invited to a one-of-a-kind theat
 er experience: be a part of a one-day play performance! Mission StageWorks
  welcomes you to experience the joy of acting and playing onstage. Here’
 s your chance to connect in a radically inclusive space. Never been on sta
 ge? Getting back into acting? Just like to perform? Perfect! This low pres
 sure environment is designed to meet people\, create characters\, play dur
 ing rehearsal\, and present short staged-reading performances with a short
