SUMMARY:Margaret Glaspy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261116T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261116T220000
DTSTAMP:20261103T025635Z
UID:dothebay-17447402@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:In an era of excess and endless distraction\, the New York-bas
 ed singer/songwriter Margaret Glaspy rejects the noise in favor of somethi
 ng far more essential. Glaspy has assembled a selection of songs that span
  from fictional vignettes to unguarded self-revelation to empathetic obser
 vation of the troubled world around her. Produced by Joe Henry (the three-
 time Grammy-winning singer/songwriter/producer known for his work with lum
 inaries like Aimee Mann and Joan Baez)\, I Am Both ultimately stands as a 
 striking new statement from one of the modern music canon’s most formida
 ble songwriters.\n\nAnna Tivel is a Portland\, Oregon-based\, internationa
 lly touring songwriter who is forever drawn to the quiet stories of ordina
 ry life. The characters and imagery that populate her writing are full of 
 breath and vivid color. With six full-length albums out and a seventh on t
 he way\, Anna has been likened to a short story writer and praised by NPR\
 , Rolling Stone\, Billboard\, and others for her keen observations of the 
 human condition. In fact\, Ann Powers of NPR Music had this to say\, "Anna
  Tivel is just one of my absolute favorite living songwriters. Her writing
  on [Outsiders] is at the same level as Paul Simon when he wrote 'The Boxe
 r' and 'American Tune'"\n\n$24-$28\, All Ages\n\nTickets: https://wl.seeti
 ckets.us/event/margaret-glaspy/693371?afflky=TheChapel\nDetails: https://d
 othebay.com/events/2026/11/16/margaret-glaspy-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.760565;-122.421188
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32548776/c086325f-f724-407c-9e3a-424c0e71d810.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261103T025635Z
LOCATION:The Chapel\, 777 Valencia Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94110
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/16/margaret-glaspy-tickets
END:VEVENT
