 e Local Edition Jazz Orchestra (LEJO) is a San Francisco big band built fr
 om a who’s who of Bay Area jazz players\, directed by trumpeter Niel Lev
 onius. Every Tuesday night since 2021\, from 8 to 11 PM\, LEJO has played 
 Local Edition\, 691 Market St\, with big band jazz from swing-era classics
  to modern original compositions. The band plays for listeners: a room ful
 l of horns\, tight arrangements and solos that stretch out. The lineup rot
 ates\, with featured vocalists and guest soloists\, so no two Tuesdays sou
 nd alike. No cover. Come for a set\, stay for the night. localeditionjazz.
 com\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://localeditionjazz.com/shows\nDetails: https
