SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Literature
DESCRIPTION:Calling all cat lovers\, travelers\, and anyone who’s ever f
 elt just a little guilty about befriending a new pet far from home.\nJoin 
 Lonely Planet and authors Diana Helmuth and Eliza Washington for a delight
 fully mischievous evening celebrating Where to Cheat on Your Cat\, an ador
 able guide on where to find cats on vacation—and how to win them over wi
 thout your cat back home ever finding out.\nDiana and Eliza will chat abou
 t the making of the book and the particular joys of feline friendships abr
 oad. Guests can unburden themselves at our Cat Confessional\, enjoy a cat-
 themed treat\, and take home a special goodie bag—including a little som
 ething for the feline friend you left behind.\nWhether you love small cats
 \, big cats\, and everything in between\, there is something for everyone.
 \nCome for the travel stories. Stay for the cats. Your secret is safe with
  us.\n****\nABOUT THIS EVENT\nThis event will be hosted by Book Passage at
  our SF Ferry Building store.\nFree Admission / Open Seating\nFollowing th
 e presentation\, there will be a signing line or a meet-and-greet.\nIf you
  are unable to attend the event\, you can still get your copy by clicking 
 the "BUY THE BOOK" button above. If you would like a signed or personalize
 d book\, please note that in the order comment field.\nFor any questions r
 egarding our events\, please contact us at books@bookpassage.com.\n\nFree\
 nBook Passage Presents:\n\nTickets: https://bookpassage.com/event/diana-he
 lmuth-eliza-washington-lonely-planet-where-cheat-your-cat\nDetails: https:
 //dothebay.com/events/2026/11/18/diana-helmuth-eliza-washington-lonely-pla
 net-where-to-cheat-on-your-cat-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
