DESCRIPTION:New this season\, Mid-Week Merriment brings a different theme 
 to the ice every Wednesday night at 8:30 p.m. The series begins November 1
 1 with Onesies Wednesday and continues with The Rhinestone Rink\, a countr
 y-glam night on November 18\, Holiday Movie Music Night on December 9\, Y2
 K Nostalgic New Year on December 29 and Rivals on Ice\, a night inspired b
 y hockey rivalries\, on January 13. Skaters are encouraged to dress the pa
 rt.\n\nAdd a little country sparkle to the holidays with a night inspired 
 by big hair\, rhinestones\, boots\, and uplifting country music. Come dres
 sed in your most fabulous country-glam look and skate to Dolly\, Kacey\, a
 nd all your other country favorites.\n\nMake Wednesday nights the highligh
 t of your week with Mid-Week Merriment\, a playful series of themed 8:30 p
 .m. skating sessions at the Holiday Ice Rink in Union Square. From cozy on
 esies and country sparkle to holiday movie favorites\, global celebrations
 \, nostalgic hits\, and more\, each week brings a new reason to dress up\,
  gather your crew\, and create unforgettable memories on the ice.\n\n$22 g
 eneral admission for adults\, $17 for children 8 and under\n\nTickets: htt
