CATEGORIES:Variety
DESCRIPTION:Port of San Francisco\, Big Art Loop\, Building 180\, Ferry Bu
 ilding\, Downtown SF Partnership + Street Plans present\nWaterfront Walkab
 out: Holiday Season Finale\nThursday\, November 19 | The Embarcadero\n\nWa
 terfront Walkabout returns for a night of captivating artist vignettes\, l
 ive music\, holiday drinks\, & seasonal memory-making.\n\nSan Francisco\, 
 this is our holiday love letter to you! After a joyous autumn of community
  and creativity\, Waterfront Walkabout returns for its season finale on Th
 ursday\, November 19.\n\nBundle up and bring your family\, friends\, and f
 our-legged companions to the waterfront's Big Art Loop – Portside for a 
 festive evening of art\, interactive experiences\, and unexpected delights
 . Explore at your own pace or sign up for a free guided tour featuring spe
 cial appearances by the artists behind the sculptures. Plus\, don't miss f
 ree professional holiday portraits at the Got Framed sculpture and the rol
 ler-skating mermaids throughout!\n\nWHATS ON DECK\n\nCorpus (Pier 14): Sto
 p by the welcome booth and meet sculptor Michael Christian\, the artist be
 hind Corpus. Get creative with holiday postcards or letters to Santa using
  custom stamps designed by Hollis Callas\, and pick up a free neon glow ne
 cklace while supplies last!\nEchoes (Ferry Terminal Plaza): Grab a brush a
 nd a beverage at a festive Paint & Sip hosted by Playful SF. Warm up with 
 complimentary hot apple cider or a craft beverage from Yerdrink\, hand rol
 l a sheet candle\, or join a club with the Chamber of Connection.\nF...\n\
 nFree\nPort of San Francisco\, Big Art Loop\, Building 180\, Ferry Buildin
 g\, Downtown SF Partnership + Street Plans present\n\nTickets: https://con
 sumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fwaterfront-wa
 lkabout-the-holiday-season-finale-tickets-2004044354612%3Faff%3Ddothebay\n
 Details: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/19/waterfront-walkabout-holid
 ay-season-finale-embarcadero-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\
 n- https://sf.funcheap.com/free-waterfront-walkabout-the-holiday-season-fi
 nale-sf/
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35407266/5f06cb64-b318-4e11-a148-bb60636d1976.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109T222818Z
LOCATION:The Embarcadero
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/19/waterfront-walkabout-holiday-se
 ason-finale-embarcadero-tickets
