CATEGORIES:Variety
DESCRIPTION:November 19\, 2026 - Brava Theatre Center\n\nVIP Doors: 5:30pm
 \n\nEarly Entry Doors: 6:30pm\n\nGeneral Admission Doors: 7:00pm\n\nShow: 
 8:00pm\n\nTo celebrate the 15th anniversary of her debut album\, Vows\, Ki
 mbra returns to the songs that marked her coming of age and introduced her
  music to the world.\n\nFor these special\, intimate performances\, she’
 ll revisit Vows\, stripping the songs back and reimagining them through th
 e lens of time passed.\n\nBeginning with Vows\, she will share stories abo
 ut what inspired the songs then and what they mean to her now. Ending in t
 he present\, Kimbra will share a glimpse of what comes next\, with new son
 gs from the album she is currently creating.\n\nAcross five studio albums\
 , Kimbra has built a career around restless transformation. The New Zealan
 d-born\, two-time Grammy Award winner moves fluidly between art-pop\, elec
 tronic music\, R&B\, jazzand experimental composition\, bringing the insti
 ncts of a songwriter\, producer\, multi-instrumentalist and fearless live 
 performer to every project.\n\nHer 2011 debut\,Vows\, reached No. 14 on th
 e Billboard 200 and was certified platinum in Australia and New Zealand\, 
 earning Kimbra major recognition at both the ARIA Awards and the New Zeala
 ndMusic Awards including best female artist two years in a row.\n\nHer col
 laboration with Gotye on “Somebody That I Used to Know” became a world
 wide No. 1 in 18countries and earned Grammy Awards for Record of the Year 
 and Best Pop Duo/Group Performance.\n\nRather than repeat that breakthroug
 h\, Kim...\n\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://www.bside.show/go/k
 imbra#id=vows-reimagined\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/19/
 kimbra-vows-reimagined-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
