DESCRIPTION:The Pancakes & Booze Art Show\nThursday\, November 19 | Public
  Works\n\nThursday\, November 19\, 7pm - 12am\nFull Space / 21+ / Limited 
 Capacity\n\nThe Bay Area's tastiest underground art event is back in San F
 rancisco with a night of high-energy culture and local talent. We’re str
 ipping away the traditional "white-cube" gallery bullshit and replacing it
  with a raw\, high-density experience that brings together over 90+ local 
 artists for one night only.\n\nWhether you're here for the art\, the music
 \, or the griddle\, this is the scene where the underground comes to life.
 \n\n90+ Local Artists: Exhibiting over 400+ original pieces of work\nUnlim
 ited Free Pancakes: Hot and fresh all night long\nLive Body Painting: Arti
 sts turning skin into living canvases\nLive Audio: Featuring local DJs and
  music producers\n\nTime: 7:00 PM – Midnight\nAdmission: $17 Early Bird 
 (+fees) / $23 Day of Show(+fees)\n\nEXHIBIT WITH US: Are you an artist or 
 maker looking to show your work? We provide the platform\; you provide the
  energy. Submit your application at www.pancakesandbooze.com/submit or ema
 il info@pancakesandbooze.com for more info.\n\nABOUT THE SHOW: Originating
  in Los Angeles in 2009\, The Pancakes & Booze Art Show has popped up over
  500 times in 40+ cities across North America and Europe. We focus on crea
 ting a non-traditional\, anything-goes environment for emerging artists to
  sell their work and for the community to engage with the local scene.\n\n
 $17-$23\, 21+\n\nTickets: https://tixr.com/af/dostuff/205817\nDetails: htt
