BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Larisa Brechun: Somnia
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T150000
DTSTAMP:20261104T195100Z
UID:dothebay-18019982@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Arts & Family
DESCRIPTION:Larisa Brechun: Somnia\nNovember 14–December 5\n\nRyan Graff
  Contemporary is excited to present Larisa Brechun's debut solo exhibition
  Somnia.\n\nThe subtle qualities of the soul—softness\, stillness\, frag
 ility\, solitude—are often belittled for their “weakness\," dismissed 
 as defects of simpering prey in a predatory age\, where might and volume r
 ule and humanity fills its hours with chatter and self-exposure. Introspec
 tion is the enemy of the social machine\, softness a death sentence\, sile
 nce a grave. And yet\, these delicate instincts are essential to the most 
 intimate operation of the soul: the dream.\n\nIn Larisa Brechuns’s Somni
 a\, the artist lays bare the quiet privacy of the dreaming mind and the fu
 gitive debris of memory\, myth\, and imagination as it freely floats in th
 e cocoon of sleep\, coalescing into mysterious forms that defy daylight lo
 gic. Under her gentle hand\, soft animal bodies take shape alongside evapo
 rating cosmic beings and primordial symbols of wilderness\, all adrift in 
 the penumbra of the dreaming state\, suspended in etheric margins between 
 the deep woodland dark and the flirting light of a winking moon.\n\nBrechu
 n’s darkness has substance\, an amplitude of unseen marrow with texture 
 and weight\, like a cave or a chrysalis. Lonely figures gently emerge from
  abyssal thickets\, twisting into the light of the omnipresent moon’s aw
 areness as quickly as they recede. They are camouflaged by silence and sha
 dow\, hiding by turns in shyness\, in stillness\, in pain\, in contemplati
 on\,...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.ryangraffcontemporary.com/larisabr
 echun\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/20/larisa-brechun-somn
 ia-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.788704;-122.4138
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35238556/dd2fda58-4107-492e-a864-87ef79255fcb.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261104T195100Z
LOCATION:Ryan Graff Contemporary\, 804 Sutter Street\, San Francisco\, CA\
 , 94109
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/20/larisa-brechun-somnia-tickets
END:VEVENT
