BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Trash Prom Walk of Shame: Runway as Performance Art
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T210000
DTSTAMP:20261111T063824Z
UID:dothebay-18062129@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:The Arts
DESCRIPTION:Jordan Joel presents the debut of their newest collection\n\nT
 rash Prom Walk of Shame\n\nTrash Prom turns shame into spectacle: alchemy\
 , excess and reclamation\, built from what the world throws away. The Walk
  of Shame becomes a walk of pride\, a celebration of personal survival in 
 scraps and iridescence.\n\nHere\, the discarded is sacred. Trash couture w
 alks alongside upcycled pieces and ready-to-wear\, each look in conversati
 on with the others. Together they carry a confession: the things we were t
 old to hide\, stitched back together and sent down the runway in full camp
  glory.\n\nShame isn’t erased. It’s raw material\, and transgression i
 s how it transforms.\n\nBeyond fashion\, the night becomes an immersive wo
 rld of performance art\, interactive installations\, music and a live atel
 ier.\n\nJoin the inaugural Queer Heartstrings\, the first iteration of a c
 ollective textile creation\, and watch transformation happen up close as y
 ou become part of the show.\n\nCome as you are\, as you were\, or as who y
 ou’re becoming.\nWalk in carrying whatever you’ve been holding\, and w
 alk out shining.\n\nFriday\, November 20\, 2026 · Monument\, 140 9th St\,
  San Francisco\nDoors: 7:00PM | Show: 8:00PM\n\n$33.85+\n\nTickets: https:
 //consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Ftrash-pr
 om-walk-of-shame-runway-as-performance-art-tickets-2003444723098\nDetails:
  https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/20/trash-prom-walk-of-shame-runway-as
 -performance-art-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://s
 f.funcheap.com/trash-prom-walk-shame-runway-performance-art-sf/
GEO:37.7754639;-122.4142567
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111T063824Z
LOCATION:Monument\, 140 9th St\, San Francicso\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/20/trash-prom-walk-of-shame-runway
 -as-performance-art-tickets
END:VEVENT
