DESCRIPTION:Layton Giordani continues to reign as a trailblazer and now la
 bel boss of MADMINDS in the\n\nhouse and techno world\, solidifying his pr
 esence at the forefront of the global scene. A New\n\nYork native\, Giorda
 ni’s journey into electronic music began in his teens\, inspired by the\
 n\nlegendary sets of Danny Tenaglia at Pacha NY. This profound experience 
 drove him to pursue a\n\ncareer behind the decks\, eventually securing a p
 ivotal residency at Output NY in Brooklyn.\n\nHere\, Giordani's talent flo
 urished\, catching the eyes of notable figures in the techno scene.\n\nGio
 rdani’s big break came under the mentorship of Adam Beyer\, the techno h
 eavyweight behind\n\nthe Drumcode label. With Beyer’s support\, Layton
 ’s debut ‘Unspoken’ EP on Truesoul\, followed\n\nquickly by his debu
 t on Drumcode with Rivington\, marked his arrival as a rising force in the
 \n\ntechno scene. His 2017 debut album ‘Where It Begins’ earned widesp
 read acclaim\, cementing\n\nhis status as a significant player.\n\nThe yea
 rs that followed were marked by monumental collaborations and career-devel
 oping hits\,\n\nincluding ‘Live Again’ with Danny Tenaglia and ‘Spac
 e Date’ with Adam Beyer and Green\n\nVelvet–the latter accumulating ov
 er 19 million streams on Spotify and reaching anthem status.\n\nGiordani's
  2020 sophomore album ‘New Generation' was a bold step forward\, blendin
 g\n\ninfluences from various genres while expanding the boundaries of his 
 own sound.\n\nHis versatility continued to shine in subsequent years with 
 releases including the ‘Hyperworl...\n\n18+\nGoldenvoice Presents\n\nTic
 kets: https://shop.axs.com/?c=axs&e=30567424546204228\nDetails: https://do
 thebay.com/events/2026/11/20/layton-giordani-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7879104;-122.4215079
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32490792/6270f6be-0e23-41e3-bf35-48cc7aa610d4.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:The Regency Ballroom\, 1290 Sutter Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94109
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/20/layton-giordani-tickets
