 y keeps going all night with DJ Euphemia playing Scorpio-driven sensual cu
 ts from the darker sides of electronic music that’ll make your fucking t
 oes curl. Dress to IMPRESS\, the Scorpios in attendance will be at peak po
 wer\, you can’t let us know you could fall under our spell ♏♏.\nBrin
 g cash tips for the babes and your bartenders\, dancing shoes\, and an imp
 ure heart 🫦\nAs always\, all love to the dancers.\nThere/there is alway
 s NOTAFLOF for Black Trans folk! You can also support us by venmoing your 
