SUMMARY:Visions of Utopia
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T190000
DTSTAMP:20261107T102259Z
UID:dothebay-18052426@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:The Arts
DESCRIPTION:Dive into the collective imagination of what our world could b
 e.\n\nThis past year Crystal Vielula - Artist and Owner of Sunshine Art Ho
 use in Inner Richmond\, SF - has been crowdsourcing individuals’ ideas o
 f utopia. She had utopia-themed collage and dance parties so we could take
  some time imagining a better world together. She took all of those collec
 tive imaginings and used them as inspiration for collage dioramas that hav
 e dance footage playing inside.\nWe’re excited to have another opportuni
 ty to collectively dream up a better world.\n\nThe preview will be held on
  Wed. Nov. 18th\nfrom 6-8pm and the reception will be on Sat. Nov. 21st fr
 om 5-8pm @sunshinearthouse\n4338 California St. San Francisco\, CA 94118\n
 \nAll of the work was created by hand\, analog/cut and paste collage\, cer
 amic sculptures\, and giant flower masks worn by dancers and filmed by Myl
 een Hollero (@hollerotron on Instagram) to create a fun alternative univer
 se where everyone can feel safe\, comfortable\, and cared for.\n\nPlease w
 ear white or light colors so that you can take on the projections in the d
 ance room.\n\nThese events are free and open to all.\n\nThank you to the S
 F Arts Commission for their support!\n\nFree\nCrystal Vielula\n\nDetails: 
 https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/21/visions-of-utopia-tickets\nSource: 
 DoTheBay
