DESCRIPTION:Drunk Theatre LLCA comedian takes five shots of whiskey in a r
 ow and tries to perform an improvised play with five sober comedians. What
  could go wrong?!\nDrunk Theatre is the entirely improvised\, unpredictabl
 e\, and crazy comedy show that’ll kick your weekend into overdrive. See 
 what the SF Chronicle\, CBS\, LA Times\, SF Weekly\, SFGate\, Thrillist\, 
 and TimeOut have all been talking about.\nThis unpredictable improv comedy
  show blends chaos\, sharp wit\, and audience interaction for a truly one
 ‑of‑a‑kind night out in the Bay Area.\nDrunk Theatre SF\nSaturday Ni
 ghts in November\nEclectic Box\, 446 Valencia Street\, SF\nGet FREE Ticket
 s – FREE for first 15 people w/ code FUNCHEAP – $23.18 adv / $25 door\
 n\nDoor opens at 9:15pm\, show starts at 9:30pm (starts promptly)\nLimited
  ticket availability at the door.\n\n*The event is open to all ages\, but 
 the comedy may not be suitable for children.\n24-hour notice is required f
 or cancelations. Late cancelations may be transferred to another show date
  of your choosing. Seating is first come\, first serve. Parties later than
  15-20 minutes may have their tickets sold at the door.\n\n2026 San Franci
 sco Drunk Theatre Schedule\nNovember – December 2026 shows\n\nSaturday\,
  November 7\, 2026 | 8:00pm – 10:00pm – Get Tickets\nSaturday\, Novemb
 er 21\, 2026 | 9:30pm – 11:00pm – Get Tickets\nSaturday\, December 5\,
  2026 | 9:30pm – 11:00pm – Get Tickets\nSaturday\, December 19\, 2026 
 | 9:30:00pm – 11:00pm – Get Tickets\n\nFollow Drunk Theatre Company on
  Instagram and Facebook for more i...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.even
 tbrite.com/e/drunk-theatre-sf-the-wildest-bay-area-comedy-tickets-20041303
 96967?discount=FUNCHEAP&amp\;aff=FuncheapSponsoredTopPick\nDetails: https:
