SUMMARY:Dark Habits
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261123T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261123T200000
DTSTAMP:20261105T200237Z
UID:dothebay-18039092@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Rejected from Cannes for being sacrilegious in its critical de
 piction of Catholicism’s role in modern Spanish society and marking a ma
 jor tone shift in Pedro Almodóvar’s filmmaking in the midst of The Movi
 da Madrileña. This piercing psychedelic tale follows cabaret singer Yolan
 da as she finds refuge in an eccentric convent at risk of financial collap
 se where the nuns call themselves The Humiliated Redeemers. There\, she fi
 nds herself among chain-smoking sisters\, a pet tiger that can only be soo
 thed by a young Carmen Maura (WOMEN ON THE VERGE OF A NERVOUS BREAKDOWN\, 
 VOLVER) playing bongos\, and erotic novel smugglers with mustache hairs th
 at blow in the wind. These characters enable each other’s vices and neur
 oses as they maintain the illusion of seeking salvation under the wing of 
 The Mother Superior\, their drug and love addicted leader who uses the mis
 sion as a means of luring in needy women. From the deteriorating convent e
 merges a potent yet playful reminder that we are all sinners that need to 
 be loved.\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 54m\n\nYear\n\n1983\n\nDirector\n\nPedro Almod
 óvar\n\nFormat\n\nDCP\n\nCountry\n\nSpain\n\nLanguage\n\nSpanish with Eng
 lish subtitles\n\nFirst Showing\n\nNovember 21\, 2026\n\nCategories\n\nIn 
 the Mood for Almodóvar\n\n\,\n\nFeatured\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.us
 west.veezi.com/purchase/22515?siteToken=4m48btf3yavn7xjk5yxk6nc40c\nDetail
 s: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/23/dark-habits-tickets\nSource: DoT
 heBay
GEO:37.7647103;-122.4224081
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35317207/775bc93a-7407-43df-8048-db945194af4b.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261105T200237Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/23/dark-habits-tickets
END:VEVENT
