 o unirse al grupo\, comuníquese con Eduardo al 415-350-3315 o envíe un c
 orreo electrónico a esiqueiros@sfaf.org.\n\nPrograma Latino Health Educat
 ion Groups\n\nJoin us to learn about HIV\, prevention\, social services\, 
 and more. This group is open to all people and will be facilitated in Span
