 et/35317190/1c98ff50-d2ba-4205-b34e-af8a83a54e4b.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261105T200237Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/24/zhang-yimou-s-raise-the-red-lan
 tern-4k-restoration-tickets
