BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mid-Week Merriment: FRIENDSGIVING at the Safeway Holiday Ice Rink 
 in Union Square Presented by Kaiser Permanente
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T223000
DTSTAMP:20261104T195100Z
UID:dothebay-18010890@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Holiday Event
DESCRIPTION:New this season\, Mid-Week Merriment brings a different theme 
 to the ice every Wednesday night at 8:30 p.m. The series begins November 1
 1 with Onesies Wednesday and continues with The Rhinestone Rink\, a countr
 y-glam night on November 18\, Holiday Movie Music Night on December 9\, Y2
 K Nostalgic New Year on December 29 and Rivals on Ice\, a night inspired b
 y hockey rivalries\, on January 13. Skaters are encouraged to dress the pa
 rt.\n\nGather your favorite people for a festive night on the ice celebrat
 ing friendship and togetherness. Skate with your crew\, snap a group photo
 \, and enjoy a feel-good playlist as you kick off the Thanksgiving festivi
 ties.\n\nMake Wednesday nights the highlight of your week with Mid-Week Me
 rriment\, a playful series of themed 8:30 p.m. skating sessions at the Hol
 iday Ice Rink in Union Square. From cozy onesies and country sparkle to ho
 liday movie favorites\, global celebrations\, nostalgic hits\, and more\, 
 each week brings a new reason to dress up\, gather your crew\, and create 
 unforgettable memories on the ice.\n\n$22 general admission for adults\, $
 17 for children 8 and under\n\nTickets: https://unionsquareicerink.com/ \n
 Details: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/25/mid-week-merriment-friends
 giving-at-the-safeway-holiday-ice-rink-in-union-square-presented-by-kaiser
 -permanente-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.787939;-122.407523
