 tle of the Decades” DJ Party (North Beach)Fri 11/20 $1 Drink Fridays: 
 “Battle of the Decades” DJ Party (North Beach)Fri 11/27 $1 Drink Frida
 ys: “Battle of the Decades” DJ Party (North Beach)Fri 12/4 $1...\n\nFr
 ee\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/battle-of-the-decades-60s-70s-
 80s-90s-dance-party-tickets-33916376796\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/
 1-drink-fridays-battle-of-the-decades-dj-party-north-beach-265/\nSource: F
