DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerCyclone Enterprises✊Black As
 s Weekend is BACK! ✊\nSkip the retail lines. We are serving the only Bla
 ck Friday plans you actually need.\nFrom Friday\, November 27th through Su
 nday\, November 29th\, Cyclone Enterprises presents Black Ass Weekend 2026
 —the ultimate celebration of Black\, queer burlesque and drag entertainm
 ent taking over the iconic Oasis SF!\nThis isn’t just a show series. It 
 is a brilliant\, unfiltered showcase of the absolute best Bay Area and int
 ernational talent. After a massive year\, we are gathering under the roof 
 of the newly upgraded Oasis showroom to give you three full days of commun
 ity\, culture\, and pure spectacle.\nSeats for the TWO cabaret showcases\,
  Moist – An All Black Erotic Cabaret are strictly limited and will sell 
 out fast! But not to worry\, we have TWO additional events\, Mo’Wet – 
 An Xtra Moist Dance Party! & FREAKNIQ – A 90’s Rooftop Day Party that 
 will also serve up some of the BEST Bay Area & BAW Feature Burlesque & Dra
 g Baddies for your turn up & throw down pleasure!\nWe’re also offering a
  day of Burlesque & Drag Workshops at The Stud presented by our Black Ass 
 Weekend Features:\nWinner of Season 2 Colorado’s Next Drag Superstar & C
 olorado’s 2026 Drag King of the Year\n✨Benjamin Banjee @benjaminbanjee
  (Denver)\nInternational Neo-Burlesque Sensation & Burlesque Hall of Fame 
 Award Winner\n✨Sandria Doré @dria_dore (Portland)\n2025 Mr. Twin Cities
  Black Diamond & Executive Director of Juneteenth Jubilee\n✨Trè Da Marc
  @tredamarc...\n\n$20.00\n\nTickets: https://www.cycloneenterprises.com/pr
 oductions/blackassweekend\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/2026-black-ass
 -weekend-black-queer-burlesque-drag-oasis-nov-2729/\nSource: Funcheap SF
