IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35317204/73d8725a-5306-4314-8f5f-b55f89d6eb66.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261105T200237Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/28/zhang-yimou-s-raise-the-red-lan
 tern-4k-restoration-tickets
