 k Store\, 224 6th St\, SF\n\nThanksgiving is passed\, the leftovers won't 
 last\, and your non-chosen families are leaving at last. The nights are ge
 tting longer\, the air is getting colder\, and everyone's looking for some
 one to keep them warm. Welcome to cuffing season.\nCome find your snuggle 
 buddy\, your Winter fling\, or your fuck buddy for the cold months ahead. 
