DESCRIPTION:“Puff Puff Laugh” SF’s Cannabis Lounge Comedy Show (Moe 
 Greens)\nBarbary Coast\nPuff Puff Laugh is Back! And now we’re on Saturd
 ays!\nHellaFunny is taking over one of SF’s premier cannabis lounges\, M
 oe Greens\, for a night of “Puff Puff Laugh.” That’s right… it’s
  the only comedy show in San Francisco where you can (legally in Californi
 a) get high during the show.\nYou’ll see a killer comedy show with a han
 dpicked lineup of 4-5 comics who normally perform at SF Sketchfest\, Cobb
 ’s Comedy Club\, Punchline and Thrive City. Plus Moe Greens has a state 
 of the art ventilation system\, rolling trays that you can borrow\, super 
 red velvet wallpaper\, comfy leather booths for you to sink into and daily
  specials.\nWe’re doing this special cannabis lounge comedy takeover. Ma
 ke sure you check the joint out before the takeover goes up in smoke.\n\n
 “Puff Puff Laugh” HellaFunny’s Moe Greens Comedy Takeover\nEvery Sat
 urday at 8pm\nMoe Greens 1276 Market St\, San Francisco\, CA 94102\nFree w
 ith Guest List RSVP\n\nIt’s a 70+ minute show with 4-5 of SF’s top loc
 al comics on the bill\n21+ only\nOne item minimum purchase required\, star
 ting at $7\n\nFAQ\nIs this comedy show really free?\nYes! Just make sure t
 o RSVP to get on the guestlist. You must be 21+.\nTell me about the one-it
 em minimum.\nIn order to hook you up with this free comedy show\, there’
 s one-item minimum purchase per person\, but it’s super affordable (and 
 way cheaper than a traditional two-drink minimum at a bar!). Pre-rolls sta
 rt at just $7\, plus there’s dail...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.uni
 verse.com/events/puff-puff-laugh-sfs-cannabis-lounge-comedy-show-tickets-0
 FM5P1\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/puff-puff-laugh-sfs-cannabis-loung
 e-comedy-show-moe-greens-137/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Barbar
 y-Coast.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261101T220810Z
LOCATION:Moe Greens\, 1276 Market St\, San Francisco\, CA 94102\, USA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/puff-puff-laugh-sfs-cannabis-lounge-comedy-sho
 w-moe-greens-137/
