UID:dothebay-18017397@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:From the legendary Studio Ghibli\, creators of Spirited Away a
 nd My Neighbor Totoro\, and Academy Award-winning director Hayao Miyazaki\
 , comes a heartwarming family adventure. When Sosuke\, a young boy who liv
 es on a clifftop overlooking the sea\, rescues a stranded goldfish named P
 onyo\, he discovers more than he bargained for. Ponyo is a curious\, energ
 etic young creature who yearns to be human\, but even as she causes chaos 
 around the house\, her father\, a powerful sorcerer\, schemes to return Po
 nyo to the sea.\n\nCinema SF Bay is proud to announce that our Saturday & 
 Sunday morning POPCORN PALACE movie screenings at the 4 STAR will continue
  to be presented FREE OF CHARGE in 2026!\n\nThanks to an incredibly genero
 us grant we will be showing you fantastic family-friendly movies every wee
 kend at 10:00 AM! Perfect for everything from birthday get-togethers to ca
 sual stop-ins\, so bring the whole family over to the 4 STAR THEATER for c
 ommunity movies together.\n\nReservations will be first-come-first-serve w
 hen the box office opens thirty minutes before the screening on the day of
  the show. Ticket links are below for later screenings of the film that da
 y. We look forward to seeing you at the movies!\n\nFor our Annual Pass Mem
 bers and Loyalty Card Holders:\n\nTickets for the afternoon screening of t
 his film can be acquired in-person at the Box Office with loyalty cards or
  our Annual CinemaSF passes on the day of the show while supplies last.\n\
 nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/20280?siteToken=d2at
 bcege5knqsavntt91g1250\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/29/po
 nyo-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.782364;-122.482951
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35228046/ba938360-930f-42f5-bd67-17f03d5dc273.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261104T195100Z
LOCATION:4 Star Theater\, 2200 Clement St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94121
