CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:de Young Museum Free Day (First Tuesdays)\nde Young Museum\nLo
 cated in beautiful Golden Gate Park\, the de Young Museum is a landmark ar
 t museum founded in 1895. Your visit includes a whirlwind trip around the 
 world as the museum’s collections feature priceless treasures and works 
 of arts from the 17th through the 20th centuries from the Americas\, texti
 le arts\, and art of Africa and Oceania.\nFree Admission Day: de Young\nFi
 rst Tuesday of the month\nOn the first Tuesday of every month\, admission 
 to the permanent galleries is free (special exhibition fees still apply).\
 n\nFree Things to See at the de Young\nEven if you don’t attend on a fre
 e day\, make sure to head up to the gorgeous glass-walled Hamon Observatio
 n Tower which offers stunning 360-degree panoramic views of downtown San F
 rancisco\, Golden Gate Park\, the Bay\, and the Marin headlands.\nAlso\, s
 troll through the whimsical Barbro Osher Sculpture Garden to see modern wo
 rks and James Turrel’s site-specific sculpture Skyspace.\nAccess to both
  the Observation Tower and the Sculpture Garden are free to the public. Pl
 ease note\, the Tower Observation Level closes one hour before the museum 
 closes.\n\nAdditional de Young Free & Discount Admission Programs\nFree Sa
 turdays for Bay Area Residents\nReserve Online and Skip the Line\nEvery Sa
 turday\, the de Young offers free general admission to all residents of th
 e nine Bay Area counties. Saturdays feature engaging art experiences for t
 he entire family\, including art making\, gallery guides\, and tour...\n\n
 Free\n\nTickets: https://www.famsf.org/visit/free-reduced-admission\nDetai
 ls: https://sf.funcheap.com/de-young-museum-free-day-first-tuesdays-70/\nS
 ource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/120453
 84_10153021040741930_3087097959298469944_o1-1.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008T104232Z
LOCATION:de Young Museum\, 50 Hagiwara Tea Garden Drive\, San Francisco\, 
 CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/de-young-museum-free-day-first-tuesdays-70/
END:VEVENT
