BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Civic Center Plaza Tree Lighting 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261202T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261202T190000
DTSTAMP:20261110T171200Z
UID:sfciviccenter-063dac71b46f481e@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:4
CATEGORIES:Community,Holiday,Kids and Families
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a festive evening at Civic Center Plaza as we illu
 minate the holiday season! The annual Civic Center Plaza Tree Lighting eve
 nt returns December 2\, 4-7pm! Add this fun\, free\, family-friendly event
  to your holiday calendar\; featuring festive performances\, with the nigh
 t’s lineup including music\, performances\, and appearances from The Tap
  Dancing Christmas Trees\, the San Francisco Boys Chorus\, the Festivus Ba
 nd\, the Grinch and the man-of-the-hour: Santa! With the night of performa
 nces all led by the Master of Ceremonies: award-winning performer Rotimi A
 gbabiaka!\nRSVP for an event day reminder on Eventbrite.\nThe event also f
 eatures “snow” flurries\, where kids (and kids at heart) can twirl and
  dance through the falling snow\, while in the Makers Village\, SF Etsy wi
 ll lead holiday-themed activities and the San Francisco Public Library wil
 l host a book giveaway. Bites will be available for purchase\, along with 
 a full bar featuring seasonal favorites.\nThe event takes place across fro
 m an illuminated City Hall in Civic Center Plaza. Event begins promptly at
  4pm\, with the lighting of Civic Center’s 50-foot noble fir at 5:30pm. 
 Happening rain or shine!\nThose who are not walking to the event are encou
 raged to take BART/Muni or park in the Civic Center Garage.\n\nDetails: ht
 tps://sfciviccenter.org/event/civic-center-plaza-tree-lighting-2026/\nSour
 ce: SF Civic Center
LAST-MODIFIED:20261110T171200Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sfciviccenter.org/event/civic-center-plaza-tree-lighting-2026/
END:VEVENT
