 K Nostalgic New Year on December 29 and Rivals on Ice\, a night inspired b
 y hockey rivalries\, on January 13. Skaters are encouraged to dress the pa
 rt.\n\nWear your brightest whites and light up the rink! Glide beneath the
  lights while enjoying festive music\, cool winter vibes\, and an unforget
 table night on the ice.\n\nMake Wednesday nights the highlight of your wee
 k with Mid-Week Merriment\, a playful series of themed 8:30 p.m. skating s
 essions at the Holiday Ice Rink in Union Square. From cozy onesies and cou
 ntry sparkle to holiday movie favorites\, global celebrations\, nostalgic 
 hits\, and more\, each week brings a new reason to dress up\, gather your 
 crew\, and create unforgettable memories on the ice.\n\n$22 general admiss
 ion for adults\, $17 for children 8 and under\n\nTickets:  https://unionsq
 uareicerink.com/ \nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/2/mid-week
