DESCRIPTION:Courtesy of PIER 39Kick Off the Holidays at PIER 39’s Annual
  Tree Lighting Celebration!\nThe holiday season is officially here\, and P
 IER 39 is kicking things off with a festive celebration you won’t want t
 o miss! Join us on Thursday\, December 3\, from 5–9 PM\, for the annual 
 lighting of PIER 39’s spectacular 60-foot Christmas tree in the Entrance
  Plaza\, bringing holiday magic to San Francisco’s waterfront.\nBring th
 e whole family\, throw on your favorite ugly sweater\, and get ready for a
 n evening filled with holiday cheer! Enjoy live music from The Death & Tax
 es Swing Band\, festive specials throughout The PIER\, and a magical visit
  from the North Pole. Plus\, take advantage of PIER 39’s Entertainment Z
 one\, where visitors can enjoy alcoholic beverages outdoors in designated 
 areas while soaking up the festive atmosphere.\n\nNEW this year: Let it sn
 ow at PIER 39! For the first time ever\, experience the magic of snowfall 
 at The PIER as we celebrate the annual tree lighting tradition with an ext
 ra touch of winter wonder.\nMake a day of it by exploring PIER 39’s fest
 ive holiday décor\, capturing picture-perfect memories\, and shopping for
  unique gifts for everyone on your holiday list. Plus\, with NEW all-day $
 15 flat-rate parking\, you can enjoy the festivities without feeling rushe
 d! Start at The PIER and make it your home base for exploring holiday cele
 brations throughout San Francisco.\nWhether you’re continuing a family t
 radition or starting a new one\, PIER 39’s Annual Tree Lighting Celebrat
 ...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.pier39.com/holidayseason/#tree-lightin
 g\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/pier-39s-60foot-christmas-tree-lightin
 g-snow-fall-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
