  what you know about sound and musical instruments with artist Ivana Dama.
  Featuring 650+ interactive exhibits and zero “Don’t Touch” signs\, 
 After Dark is the place to test the boundaries of science and art. Dress t
 o transgress\, challenge your own expectations\, and go home different.\n\
 nAfter Dark Thursday Nights\nThis event is part of our After Dark Thursday
  Nights series. Unplug and play with 700+ interactive exhibits exploring s
 cience\, art\, and perception. Learn more.\n\n6–10 p.m.\nAdults Only (Ag
 es 18+)\nThe Exploratorium\, Pier 15\, San Francisco\n\n18+\n\nTickets: ht
 tps://www.exploratorium.edu/visit/calendar/after-dark-rule-breakers\nDetai
