 663_18031112828897469_115452629079591010_n-1.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:San Francisco State University Observatory\, Thornton Hall\, 10th
  Floor San Francisco State University 1600 Holloway Avenue San Francisco\,
  CA 94132
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
