DESCRIPTION:Join us for a free program of short films and videos! Artists
 ’ Television Access presents Open Screening\, an ongoing series where in
 dependent filmmakers can share their work up on our big screen. We welcome
  short-format film and video (15 min. or less) from all genres\, including
  music videos\, animations\, narrative short films\, documentaries\, and e
 xperimental work.\n\nOpen Screening is held on the first Thursday of each 
 month. Show starts at 8:00\, doors open at 7:30. To submit your work in ad
