DESCRIPTION:Union Square’s 2026 Chanukah Festival: 25-Foot-Tall Menorah 
 (Dec. 4-11)\nBill Graham Menorah\nLighting it up since 1975\, San Francisc
 o celebrates the 51st anniversary of the first giant public menorah outsid
 e Israel\, a landmark Bill Graham project that inspired thousands of menor
 ahs around the world. This year’s eight-night celebration brings music\,
  community gatherings\, and nightly ceremonies honoring leaders and tradit
 ions across the Jewish community.\n\nUnion Square Menorah Lighting Schedul
 e 2026\nDecember 4-11\, 2026\nFriday\, December 4\n\n2:30 pm – 1st Light
 ing Ceremony\n\nSaturday\, December 5\n\n8:00 pm – 2nd Lighting Ceremony
 \n\nCeremony lasts approximately 20 minutes\, followed by music and dancin
 g.\n\nSunday\, December 6\n“Bill Graham Menorah Day“\n\n2:00-6:30 pm 
 – Family Celebration and 3rd Lighting Ceremony\n2:30-4:30 pm – Dreidel
  House Children’s Crafts\n2:00 pm – Children’s Chanukah Show\n3:00 p
 m – Live Music (Band TBA)\n4:00-6:30 pm – Bill Graham All Stars featur
 ing Jordan Feinstein (keys/vocals\, Jordan and the Ritual)\, Aaron Kaplan 
 (guitar)\, Ben Bernstein (bass)\, and Greg Errico (drums\, original Sly an
 d the Family Stone)\n5:00 pm – Menorah Lighting Ceremony honoring Friend
 s of Bill\, dignitaries and special guests\n\nMonday\, December 7\n\n4:30 
 pm – Live Music\n5:00 pm – 4th Lighting Ceremony\n\nCeremony lasts app
 roximately 20 minutes\, followed by music and dancing.\n\nTuesday\, Decemb
 er 8\n\n4:30 pm – Live Music\n5:00 pm – 5th Lighting Ceremony\n\nCerem
 ony lasts approximately 20 minutes\, followed by mus...\n\nFree\n\nTickets
 : https://www.billgrahammenorah.org/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/uni
 on-squares-chanukah-festival/\nSource: Funcheap SF
