DESCRIPTION:Illustration by Nicole AlbumGet ready to kick off the most mag
 ical season of the year! The Hayes Valley Merchants Council (HVMC) and the
  Hayes Valley Neighborhood Association (HVNA) are thrilled to invite neigh
 bors\, families\, and visitors from near and far to the annual Hayes Valle
 y Holiday Stroll on Friday\, December 4\, 2026\, from 5:00 PM to 8:00 PM.\
 nThanks to a generous grant from Avenue Greenlight\, this beloved neighbor
 hood tradition is completely free and packed with festive surprises for al
 l ages.\nFor one night only\, the streets will come alive with enchanting\
 , oversized light sculptures from Astro Botanicals\, creating a stunning v
 isual backdrop for an unforgettable evening. Strollers can soak in the hol
 iday vibes with live music from local bands\, and extraordinary street per
 formances\, including:\n\nBands playing at various locations around Hayes 
 Valley: Leah Froyd Insight Chamber Orchestra\, Marjolein Shiamety Trio\, E
 ric Glauser\, Marco Cassola\, Giuseppe Pinto\, The Leafs\nThe Mistletoe Ca
 rolers spreading classic vocal harmony and holiday cheer\nThe high-steppin
 g\, crowd-favorite Tap Dancing Christmas Trees\nA special photo-op visit f
 rom The Abominable Snowman\nFree face painting by Suzy\nFree hands-on orna
 ment craft station thanks to Maker Studio Kidz\n\n“The Hayes Valley Holi
 day Stroll is a cherished annual tradition.” says HVNA president Joe Mal
 oney. “Come out for holiday cheer\, carolers\, and drag queens\, plus de
 als and freebies from neighborhood shops. We even make it snow in Hay...\n
 \nFree\n\nTickets: https://hayesvalleyholidaystroll.com\nDetails: https://
 sf.funcheap.com/free-2026-hayes-vally-holiday-stroll-snowfall-tap-dancing-
 trees-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
