CATEGORIES:Fairs Festivals
DESCRIPTION:Union Square’s 2026 Chanukah Festival: 25-Foot-Tall Menorah 
 (Dec. 4-11)\nBill Graham Menorah\nLighting it up since 1975\, San Francisc
 o celebrates the 51st anniversary of the first giant public menorah outsid
 e Israel\, a landmark Bill Graham project that inspired thousands of menor
 ahs around the world. This year’s eight-night celebration brings music\,
  community gatherings\, and nightly ceremonies honoring leaders and tradit
 ions across the Jewish community.\nThe festival is capped off with a festi
 ve menorah car parade rolling out from Union Square (date TBA).\n\nUnion S
 quare Menorah Lighting Schedule 2026\nDecember 4-11\, 2026\nFriday\, Decem
 ber 4\n\n2:30 pm – 1st Lighting Ceremony\n\nSaturday\, December 5\n\n8:0
 0 pm – 2nd Lighting Ceremony\n\nCeremony lasts approximately 20 minutes\
 , followed by music and dancing.\n\nSunday\, December 6\n“Bill Graham Me
 norah Day“\n\n2:00-6:30 pm – Family Celebration and 3rd Lighting Cerem
 ony\n2:30-4:30 pm – Dreidel House Children’s Crafts\n2:00 pm – Child
 ren’s Chanukah Show\n3:00 pm – Live Music (Band TBA)\n4:00-6:30 pm –
  Bill Graham All Stars featuring Jordan Feinstein (keys/vocals\, Jordan an
 d the Ritual)\, Aaron Kaplan (guitar)\, Ben Bernstein (bass)\, and Greg Er
 rico (drums\, original Sly and the Family Stone)\n5:00 pm – Menorah Ligh
 ting Ceremony honoring Friends of Bill\, dignitaries and special guests\n\
 nMonday\, December 7\n\n4:30 pm – Live Music\n5:00 pm – 4th Lighting C
 eremony\n\nCeremony lasts approximately 20 minutes\, followed by music and
  dancing.\n\nTuesday\, December 8\n\n4:30 pm...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https:
 //www.billgrahammenorah.org/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/union-squar
 es-2026-chanukah-festival-25-foot-tall-menorah-2nd-night/\nSource: Funchea
 p SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/2252-1
 stNightUnionSquare-211128.jpeg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261107T005802Z
LOCATION:Union Square Park\, Geary and Powell\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/union-squares-2026-chanukah-festival-25-foot-t
 all-menorah-2nd-night/
END:VEVENT
