DESCRIPTION:Join us for our second annual Winter Faire! We’re excited to
  have you be a part of this tradition. Celebrate the season with kids’ m
 usic\, crafts\, and activities\, as well as holiday tunes by local musicia
 ns. Take a candle making or succulent wreath workshop in the afternoon. En
 joy a complimentary hot chocolate from The Quenched Trailer and soak in th
 e festive atmosphere. Shop our collection of locally sourced gifts and hol
 iday decor. We’ll be donating 5% of all pretax sales to Food Bank of Con
 tra Costa & Solano all day!\n\nSunday\, December 6\nConcord Schedule of Ev
 ents:\nAll Festivities from 10:00am to 3:00pm\n10:00am to 3:00pm Kids Club
  Activities\n10:30am Music Time with Farmer Arann\n12:00pm Live Holiday Mu
 sic from Local Musicians\n2:00pm Create a Succulent Wreath Workshop ($115)
 . Please call the store to sign up (925) 681-0550\nKids Club Activities in
 cluding coloring\, ornament making\, scavenger hunts and more!\n\nCheckout
  the other Winter Faire dates:\n11/22 Novato\n12/13 Sloat Blvd\, SF\n\nPub
 lished by Sloat Garden Center\nContains information from CalDiscovery (cal
 discovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://sloatgardens.com/event/conco
 rd-winter-faire-2026/?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=
 san-francisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111T063824Z
LOCATION:Sloat Concord\, 1555 Kirker Pass Rd\, Concord\, 94521\, United St
 ates
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sloatgardens.com/event/concord-winter-faire-2026/?utm_source=c
 aldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
