 ears of music\, memories\, and community at Bottom of the Hill.\nWhile Bot
 tom of the Hill isn’t closing for good\, we’re marking the end of an e
 ra and saying farewell to three women who helped make this place what it i
 s: Lynn\, Kathleen\, and Ramona.\n\nFor 35 years\, these leading ladies ha
 ve been the heart and soul of Bottom of the Hill. The music community owes
  these ladies more than we could ever repay. Presented by Trixie Rasputin\
 , this night is for the scene\, by the scene.\nHeadliner: Spencer Noble\nF
 eaturing: Nina Durango\, Arcade 9\, Good For Your Bones\nWith: MC Stefan A
 ronsen & BlckSpkz\n\n$15.00\n\nTickets: https://dice.fm/partner/tickets/ev
