DESCRIPTION:“Let’s Glow SF” 2026: SF’s Huge Holiday Projection Art
 s Festival (Dec. 4-13)\nDowntown San Francisco Partnership\nLet’s Glow S
 F\, the nation’s largest free holiday projection arts festival\, is ligh
 ting up downtown San Francisco once again for its sixth and brightest year
  yet.\nThis all-ages\, family-friendly festival runs for 10 dazzling night
 s from December 4-13\, 2026. Experience breathtaking animated projections 
 illuminating iconic buildings across downtown San Francisco\, transforming
  them into colossal\, colorful canvases featuring spectacular artwork by 1
 9 artists from around the globe. It’s a larger-than-life holiday light s
 how that turns the heart of the city into an open-air art gallery after da
 rk.\n\n2026 Let’s Glow SF Festival Showtimes\n\nFriday\, December 4: Cou
 ntdown to Glow opening-night celebration\, 6-7pm at Harry Bridges Plaza in
  front of the Ferry Building.\nFriday\, December 4: Festival projections\,
  7-10pm.\nDecember 5-13: Nightly projections\, 5:30-10pm.\n\n2026 Show Loc
 ations (map)\n\nFerry Building (1 Ferry Building) – Best viewed from Har
 ry Bridges Plaza.\n101 California St. (101 California St.) – Best viewed
  from inside 101 California Plaza.\nPacific Exchange (301 Pine St.) – Be
 st viewed from 300 Pine Street.\nHobart Building (582 Market St.) – Best
  viewed from 1 Post Street.\nYerba Buena Lane (Market St.) – Best viewed
  from Yerba Buena Lane off Market Street.\nSalesforce Tower (415 Mission S
 t.) – Best viewed from anywhere in downtown.\n\nLGSF Business Specials\n
 Participating down...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.downtownsf.org/event
 s/letsglowsf/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/lets-glow-sf-2026-sfs-huge
 -holiday-projection-arts-festival-dec-4-13-7/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Lets-G
 low-SF.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261104T012711Z
LOCATION:San Francisco’s Financial District\, Market at Sutter Street\, 
 San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/lets-glow-sf-2026-sfs-huge-holiday-projection-
 arts-festival-dec-4-13-7/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Irish Women’s Short Film Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261211T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261211T220000
DTSTAMP:20261029T100747Z
UID:caldiscovery-festival-88774a35acaa79bf@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:festival,film
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening of Irish storytelling through film. The
  Irish Women’s Short Film Festival brings together 11 short films celebr
 ating the voices and visions of women filmmakers in Ireland and across the
  global Irish diaspora.\nTICKETS\n\nFrom questions of identity and migrati
 on to family\, grief\, faith\, resilience\, and finding one’s voice\, th
 ese films explore the many ways women make sense of where they come from
 —and where they are going. Their stories cross generations and borders\,
  offering moments of honesty\, tenderness\, strength\, and recognition.\nC
 reated by co-producers Jeanne McInerney and Orlaith Carr\, the festival gr
 ew from conversations about womanhood\, belonging\, inheritance\, and the 
 layered experience of being Irish across generations and oceans. Recent Au
 stralian screenings in Adelaide\, Melbourne\, and Sydney sold out\, bringi
 ng audiences together around stories that resonated across the diaspora.\n
 Come for the films\, stay for the company. The evening offers a relaxed\, 
 welcoming chance to meet fellow film lovers\, creatives\, and members of t
 he Irish community—and to share in the conversations these stories inspi
 re.\nBring a friend and join us at the UICC for a memorable night of film 
 and connection.\nSpace is limited\; advance tickets are $15.\n\nPublished 
 by United Irish Cultural Center of San Francisco\nContains information fro
 m CalDiscovery (caldiscovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://irishcent
 ersf.org/event/the-irish-womens-short-film-festival/?utm_source=caldiscove
 ry&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
LAST-MODIFIED:20261029T100747Z
LOCATION:United Irish Cultural Center\, 2700 45th Avenue\, SAN FRANCISCO\,
  CA\, 94116\, United States
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://irishcentersf.org/event/the-irish-womens-short-film-festival/?
 utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
END:VEVENT
