DESCRIPTION:Holidays with the Symphony\nDr. Seuss's How the Grinch Stole C
 hristmas—Film with Live Orchestra\nFriday\, December 11 | Davies Symphon
 y Hall\n\nJim Carrey stars as the curmudgeonly Grinch\, who plans to ruin 
 Christmas for the citizens of Whoville—will they manage to warm his icy 
 heart? Enjoy this festive film on the big screen like never before as the 
 San Francisco Symphony performs James Horner’s score live. Rated PG.\n\n
 Concert Extras\nThroughout December\, stroll through the winter wonderland
  of a decked-out Davies Symphony Hall\, filled with giant lit trees\, wrea
 ths\, and garlands. While you’re here\, sip a gingerbread old-fashioned\
 , toast with sparkling wine\, enjoy holiday desserts\, and swing by the ho
 t-chocolate cart all month long.\n\nArtists\n\nJoshua Gersen\, Conductor\n
 San Francisco Symphony\n\nFilm\n\nJanes Horner\, Composer\nRon Howard\, Di
 rector\n\nHolidays with the Symphony\n\nTickets: https://www.sfsymphony.or
 g/Buy-Tickets/2026-27/Grinch\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12
