DESCRIPTION:GISSVThe German Holiday Market recreates the jovial atmosphere
  of a traditional open-air\, European winter market on Mountain View’s C
 ity Hall Plaza. Shop for unique\, handcrafted gifts from Germany and local
  artisans: Wood ornaments and nutcrackers from Germany\, Lebkuchen (ginger
 bread)\, Stollen\, chocolate\, toys\, ceramics\, and knitwear. Taste tradi
 tional German sausages and pretzels and warm up with a mug of Glühwein (w
 arm mulled wine)\, the hallmark of these winter markets. The German Holida
 y Market offers plenty of activities for the entire family\, including liv
 e performances and arts and crafts.\nThe Market is a 10-minute walk from t
 he Mountain View transit center\, a lovely stroll along Castro Street wher
 e you will find more shopping and more eateries. Just like in Europe\, arr
 ive on foot to the Weihnachtsmarkt!\nRain or Shine! Join us! Admission is 
 free!\n\nYou are invited to step into Germany for a day\, no passport need
 ed. Come enjoy this seasonal celebration!\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://germ
 anholidaymarket.org/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/authentic-german-ho
 liday-market-mountain-view-city-hall-plaza-2025/\nSource: Funcheap SF
