DESCRIPTION:Join us for our second annual Winter Faire! We’re excited to
  have you be a part of this tradition. Celebrate the season with kids’ m
 usic\, crafts\, and activities\, as well as holiday tunes by local musicia
 ns. Take a candle making or succulent wreath workshop in the afternoon. En
 joy a complimentary hot chocolate from The Quenched Trailer and soak in th
 e festive atmosphere. Shop our collection of locally sourced gifts and hol
 iday decor. We’ll be donating 5% of all pretax sales to SF-Marin Food Ba
 nk all day!\n\nSunday\, December 13\nSloat Blvd\, San Francisco Schedule o
 f Events:\nAll festivities are from 10:00am to 3:00pm\n10:30am Music Time 
 with Farmer Arann\n12:00pm Live Holiday Music from Local Musicians\n1:00pm
  Candle Making Workshop ($45). Please call the store to sign up (415) 566-
 4415\n2:00pm Create a Succulent Wreath Workshop ($115). Please call the st
 ore to sign up (415) 566-4415\n10:00am to 3:00pm Kids Club Activities incl
 uding coloring\, ornament making\, scavenger hunts and more!\n\nCheckout t
 he other Winter Faire dates:\n11/22 Novato\n12/6 Concord\n\nPublished by S
 loat Garden Center\nContains information from CalDiscovery (caldiscovery.c
 om)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://sloatgardens.com/event/sloat-blvd-sf-wi
 nter-faire-2026/?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-f
 rancisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
LAST-MODIFIED:20261112T112617Z
LOCATION:Sloat Boulevard\, SF\, 2700 Sloat Blvd\, San Francisco\, CA\, 941
 16\, United States
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
