DESCRIPTION:Category: Art / Photography / Crafts\,Community Events / Volun
 teerism\,Festivals / ParadesContact Phone: 510-842-6876Contact Email: ebos
 @oaklandartmurmur.orgCost: FreeLink: https://www.eastbayopenstudios.comEas
 t Bay Open Studios returns for two free weekends with over 180 artists ope
 ning their studios to the public. This free\, self-guided event invites yo
 u to wander into local studios\, galleries\, and community hubs in Oakland
 \, Berkeley\, and beyond. Come curious — meet the creative minds behind 
 the work\, experience art where it's made\, and leave inspired.Not sure wh
 ere to start? Explore our Emerging Artists\, Community Hubs\, or find your
  favorite artwork using our Artist Directory!🗓️ Open Studios: Dec 5-6
  and 12-13\; 11am–5pm daily 📍 Art in your neighborhoods across the Ea
 st Bay🎫 Get your free ticket: EventbriteHOW TO PARTICIPATE:1. Visit eas
 tbayopenstudios.com2. Browse artist profiles or use the interactive maps (
 Weekend 1 + Weekend 2)3. Don't know where to start? Check out our Emerging
  Artists\,Community Hubs\, and Special Events.4. Choose your route and hit
  the studios! Open 11am–5pm each day\n\nPublished by KGO\nContains infor
 mation from CalDiscovery (caldiscovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https:/
 /www.eastbayopenstudios.com?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_cam
 paign=san-francisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
