CATEGORIES:LGBTQ
DESCRIPTION:Santa Skivvies Run is San Francisco AIDS Foundation’s iconic
  holiday fun run through the Castro—where participants strip down to the
 ir skivvies (or best festive gear) to raise funds for HIV prevention\, car
 e\, and harm reduction services.\n\nBy registering\, fundraising\, or dona
 ting\, you help provide free HIV and STI testing\, access to PrEP and PEP\
 , overdose prevention and syringe access\, and community programs that sup
 port people living with or at risk for HIV. Join us\, have a blast\, and m
 ake a real impact for the health and wellbeing of our community.\n\nEVENT 
 DETAILS\n\n11:00 AM - 11:45 AM - Registration & Check-in\n\n12:00 PM - 12:
 30 PM - Run through the Castro\n\n11:30 AM - 1: 00 PM - Santa's Drag Show 
 and award ceremony\n\n1:00 PM - 5:00 PM - After party at LOOKOUT\n\n$50 re
 gistration fee\; 21+\nSan Francisco AIDS Foundation Presents:\n\nTickets: 
 https://donate.sfaf.org/event/santa-skivvies-2026/e773343?utm_source=dothe
 bay&utm_medium=event&utm_campaign=santa_skivvies_2026\nDetails: https://do
 thebay.com/events/2026/12/13/santa-skivvies-run-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\
 n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/santa-skivvies-run-castro-sf
 /\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/santa-skivvies-run-castro-2026/
