BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bitter Christmas
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261216T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261216T200000
DTSTAMP:20261109T222818Z
UID:dothebay-18053216@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Check out IN THE MOOD FOR ALMODÓVAR\, our limited series cele
 brating three earlier works by Pedro Almodóvar.\n\nThe incomparable Almod
 óvar has been rendering the life of the creative mind on screen for five 
 decades\, with exquisite attention to every nuance of both aesthetic desig
 n and human emotion. With his complexly conceived latest\, he uses a metac
 inematic framework to explore the artist’s tenuous relationship between 
 fiction and reality. The sublimely expressive Bárbara Lennie stars as Els
 a\, a well-known actress suffering from debilitating migraines whose direc
 torial efforts had failed upon release but have become cult classics. Whil
 e trying to maintain a relationship with her loyal boyfriend Bonifacio (Pa
 trick Criado)\, a fireman moonlighting as a stripper\, she becomes inspire
 d by the travails of her friends to write a new script.\n\nYet Elsa’s st
 ory is itself a story—being written by Raúl (Leonardo Sbaraglia)\, an A
 lmodóvar-esque filmmaker who is\, in turn\, taking his cues from the live
 s of those around him. Mixing the irreverence of early Almodóvar with the
  somber melodrama of his later work\, Bitter Christmas insightfully detail
 s the vampiric nature of artistic creation and how we use fiction to try a
 nd right the wrongs of our lives.\n\n“With its moving musical interludes
 \, comic patter and outrageously chic production design\, Bitter Christmas
  is another dazzling\, late-period jewel” — Little White Lies\n\nMore 
 showtimes coming soon\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 52m\n\nYear\n\n2026\n\nDirector\n\n
 Pedro Almo...\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/2253
 4?siteToken=4m48btf3yavn7xjk5yxk6nc40c\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/even
 ts/2026/12/16/bitter-christmas-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7647103;-122.4224081
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35374321/24385c8e-0252-4d70-9f59-6e0f2f4b50ca.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109T222818Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/16/bitter-christmas-tickets
END:VEVENT
