 ium After Dark. Play with light and shadow\, dive into traditions around t
 he world\, and encounter artworks inspired by the darkest night of the yea
 r. Don’t forget to bask in the radiance of Glow\, our seasonal exhibitio
 n bringing brand-new artworks to Pier 15.\n\nAfter Dark Thursday Nights\nT
 his event is part of our After Dark Thursday Nights series. Unplug and pla
 y with 700+ interactive exhibits exploring science\, art\, and perception.
