DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerCorte Madera Town BandMake pla
 ns to attend the Corte Madera Town Band’s annual holiday concert. Here a
 re the details:\n– Date: Thursday\, December 17\, 2026\n\n– Time: 7pm 
 PST\n– Where: Corte Madera Community Center\, 498 Tamalpais Drive\, Cort
 e Madera 94925\n– Admission: FREE!\n\nUnder the baton of new Conductor A
 lan Parks\, the 40-piece Corte Madera Town Band (CMTB) will ring in the ho
 liday season in true style at its 2026 Holiday Concert! Be there to celebr
 ate a fun evening of great seasonal music\, great friends\, and holiday sp
 irit! Refreshments will be served.\n\nRegarding the music being performed\
 , here is how CMTB President Larry Hetrick describes the selections: “De
 cember is such a wonderful month for celebrating music. We will performing
  a number of Christmas melodies\, a Hanukkah selection\, traditional favor
 ites\, and much more. It will be an hour of great\, light entertainment.
 ”\n\nThe Corte Madera Town Band is actively recruiting new members while
  working hard to raise the group’s visibility. Learn more at CorteMadera
 TownBand.org.\n\nGenerous support for this concert is provided by the Town
  of Corte Madera\, the Corte Madera Community Foundation\, Corte Madera Li
 ons\, and fans like you! The CMTB – also known as “Marin’s Own” 
 – greatly appreciates all of its supporters.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https:/
 /CorteMaderaTownBand.org\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-2026-holid
 ay-concert-40piece-town-band-corte-madera/\nSource: Funcheap SF
