DESCRIPTION:SF’s Free “Sundays at the Beach” Tai Chi Day (Great High
 way)\nGreat Highway Park\nJoin us for Tai Chi this Sunday!\n10am at Judah 
 and Great Highway Park\nThis monthly course is for beginners and experienc
 ed students of tai chi alike. Plus\, coffee is on us at @javabeachsf after
  the course.\nAs a reminder\, Sundays at the Beach is a year-long program 
 of weekly events possible thanks to a grant award from @avenuegreenlight. 
 Our friends at @sunsetchineseculturaldistrict helped us make the Tai Chi p
 rogram come to life!\n\nSee you on Sundays!\n\nView this post on Instagram
 \n\nA post shared by Great Highway Park (@greathighwaypark)\n\nUpcoming SF
 ’s Free “Sundays at the Beach” Tai Chi Day (Great Highway) Events\nS
 un 10/18 SF’s Free “Sundays at the Beach” Tai Chi Day (Great Highway
 )Sun 11/15 SF’s Free “Sundays at the Beach” Tai Chi Day (Great Highw
 ay)Sun 12/20 SF’s Free “Sundays at the Beach” Tai Chi Day (Great Hig
 hway)Disclaimer: Please double check event information with the event orga
