DESCRIPTION:Burnt out by the LA adult film scene\, washed-up porn star Mik
 ey Saber (Simon Rex) heads back to his old stomping grounds in small-town 
 Texas. After a not-so-successful attempt at reconnecting with his estrange
 d wife\, Lexi (Bree Elrod)\, he forms an instant connection with Strawberr
 y (Suzanna Son). Soon he’s juggling jealous exes\, new love\, and drug-d
 ealing locals\, all with a smile on his face. Who says you can’t go home
  again?\n\nThe audacious new film from writer-director Sean Baker (THE FLO
 RIDA PROJECT\, TANGERINE)\, starring Simon Rex in a magnetic\, live-wire p
 erformance\, RED ROCKET is a darkly funny and humane portrait of a uniquel
 y American hustler and the hometown that barely tolerates him.\n\nTickets:
  https://drafthouse.com/sf/show/a24-x-alamo-cinema-club-mandatory-bundle-r
 ed-rocket?cinemaId=0802&sessionId=23533\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/eve
 nts/2026/12/21/red-rocket-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
