SUMMARY:QUEERSADA 2026: A Queer Posada
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261225T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261225T160000
DTSTAMP:20261106T192930Z
UID:dothebay-18044370@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:LGBTQ
DESCRIPTION:A catered meal\, chosen family vibes\, and a place to kick it\
 , all on Christmas Day.\n\nFor the fourth year\, our annual FREE community
  meal returns!\nIt's a party\, with catered food\, movies on the screens\,
  and chosen family vibes all afternoon.\n\nWe'll have pozole\, pan con pav
 o\, and more on the menu. The bar will be open (cash and credit card accep
 ted) for any drinks you need. The food is on us\, the drinks are on you.\n
 \nHow can you contribute? Bring a dessert you think people would like. Any
 thing is a good thing!\n\nAnd here's the thing: whether you celebrate the 
 holiday or not isn't what we are concerned with.\n\nThe reality is\, this 
 can be a very challenging day for our community. Isolation\, disconnection
 \, hunger...\n\nThere is no reason we can't come together to make sure eve
 rybody has a safe\, affirming place to go\, and a good\, dignified meal to
  eat\, all in a familiar space.\n\nAnd that's the thing: community is for 
 everyone\, regardless of age\, income\, professional or academic backgroun
 d\, body type\, and so on.\n\nQuestions? Follow us on IG and send us a DM:
  @boss.ideahouse\n\nThe event is free\, but we are asking for each person 
 coming to RSVP so we can keep an eye on the food and seating availability.
 \n\nFree\nBOSS IDEA HOUSE\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://consum
 er.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fqueersada-a-quee
 r-posada-tickets-2003978398335%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://dot
 hebay.com/events/2026/12/25/queersada-2026-a-queer-posada-tickets\nSource:
  DoTheBay
