DESCRIPTION:SF’s “Sundays at the Beach” Free Yoga Day (Great Highway
 )\nGreat Highway Park\nCome flow with us every 4th Sundays! After the comm
 unity yoga class\, enjoy a cup of coffee on us at @javabeachsf to warm you
  up from our San Francisco summer weather.\n12pm\, Judah and Great Highway
  Park\nBYO mat and coffee mug. No registration required\, just show up and
  enjoy yoga to the sound of waves.\n\nSundays at the Beach are possible th
 anks to a grant award from @avenuegreenlight and help from our friends acr
 oss the community like @yogabeachsf for helping us bring weekly joy the ne
 ighborhood.\n\nView this post on Instagram\n\nA post shared by Great Highw
 ay Park (@greathighwaypark)\n\nUpcoming SF’s “Sundays at the Beach” 
