DESCRIPTION:Early show starts at 8 PM and ends by 9:30 PM\n\nGet your New 
 Year's Eve started off right with Cheaper Than Therapy! Your ticket gets y
 ou into the Shelton Theater to start laughing at 8 PM on December 31\, 202
 6. Champagne is included! The party will wrap up in time for the 10:30 PM 
 show.\n\nCheaper Than Therapy offers a healthy dose of live stand-up comed
 y every Wednesday\, Thursday\, Friday\, Saturday\, and Sunday\, year-round
 . Located in San Francisco's historic Shelton Theater in the heart of Unio
 n Square\, Cheaper Than Therapy is convenient to get to\, whether you live
  in the Bay Area or are just visiting.\n\nCheck out our reviews on Yelp\, 
 Google\, and Facebook.\n\nAbout the show\n\nEach show features five to six
  hand-picked\, experienced comedians and an occasional guest drop-in.\n\nP
 lease arrive at the theater by 7:45 PM to check in with the box office. Th
 e bar opens at 7 PM\, and the show starts at 8 PM. Last seating is at 8:20
  PM.\n\nThe theater has a full bar with no drink minimum. Come early for c
 raft drinks and great seats!\n\nThe early New Year's Eve 2026 show will en
 d by 9:30 PM and clear out by 10 PM. If public transit agencies work as in
  previous years\, we expect that BART will offer special service from 8 PM
  December 31\, 2026\, till 3 AM January 1\, 2027\; and MUNI will offer fre
 e NYE service from 8 PM December 31\, 2026\, till 5 AM January 1\, 2027. F
 or a list of restaurant recommendations in the area\, please visit our web
 site.\n\nWe encourage everyone 21+ to party with us at the Shelton Thea...
 \n\n$55\, 18+\nCTT Comedy presents\n\nTickets: https://tickets.cttcomedy.c
 om/events/2675/cheaper-than-therapy-stand-up-comedy-new-year-s-eve-2026-8p
 m/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/31/cheaper-than-therapy-n
 ew-year-s-eve-2026-8-pm-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
