DESCRIPTION:For tickets or more information about The Empress SF yacht New
  Year's Eve party\, visit us at NewYears.com\nEnter 2027 on a wild NYE par
 ty cruise in the Golden City aboard the Empress Yacht! We’re ending the 
 year with a bang\; cruising on The Bay\, dancing\, drinking\, and getting 
 the absolute best views of the annual fireworks show. Sounds like fun\, do
 esn’t it? Order your tickets to this superb San Francisco New Year’s E
 ve yacht party now\, before it’s too late.\n\nA truly stylish vessel\, t
 his yacht sports hardwood finishings throughout its climate-controlled int
 erior\, and panoramic window displays on each deck. Take in the truly asto
 nishing views of The Bay\, and enjoy a sweet vantage point for the yearly 
 fireworks show.\n\nFrom the moment you step aboard\, you’ll hear the sou
 nds of our live DJ cutting it up with a mix of the latest and greatest hit
 s\, anthems\, and bangers. Grab a tasty app from the tray-passed hors d’
 oeuvres\, then become acquainted with the bartender as you take advantage 
 of the 3-hour open bar.\n\nDon’t be shy\, get social with us!! We know h
 ow much you just love capturing memories on that phone of yours. Why not s
 hare those memories with the rest of us on Instagram\, Twitter\, and Faceb
 ook? We want to see all those awesome pics and vids too! So you better not
  forget to tag us. While you’re at it\, use hashtag #NYEOnTheBay so ever
 yone knows where the real party’s at.\n\nEmpress Yacht San Francisco\nPi
 er 40 - 89 King Street\nSan Francisco\, CA 94107\n\n• BOARDING:Dec 31\, 
 2026 @ 9:30...\n\n$169 Per Person (21+)\nNewyears.com Presents\n\nTickets:
  https://www.newyears.com/e/empress-yacht-san-francisco?affiliate=dtb\nDet
 ails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/31/empress-yacht-sf-new-years-ev
 e-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
