BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cheaper Than Therapy: New Year's Eve 2026 @ 10:30 PM
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261231T223000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270101T003000
DTSTAMP:20261101T160546Z
UID:dothebay-17911932@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy
DESCRIPTION:Late show starts at 10:30 PM\n\nRing in the new year with Chea
 per Than Therapy! Your ticket gets you into the Shelton Theater to start l
 aughing at 10:30 PM on December 31\, 2026\, and includes a champagne toast
  at midnight. Join us for an after-party to welcome 2027 with live musicia
 ns.\n\nCheaper Than Therapy offers a healthy dose of live stand-up comedy 
 every Wednesday\, Thursday\, Friday\, Saturday\, and Sunday\, year-round. 
 Located in San Francisco's historic Shelton Theater in the heart of Union 
 Square\, Cheaper Than Therapy is convenient to get to\, whether you live i
 n the Bay Area or are just visiting.\n\nCheck out our reviews on Yelp\, Go
 ogle\, and Facebook.\n\nAbout the show\n\nEach show features five to six h
 and-picked\, experienced comedians and an occasional guest drop-in.\n\nPle
 ase arrive at the theater by 10:15 PM to check in with the box office. The
  bar opens at 9:30 PM\, and the show starts at 10:30 PM. Last seating is a
 t 10:50 PM.\n\nThe theater has a full bar with no drink minimum. Come earl
 y for craft drinks and great seats!\n\nThe early New Year's Eve show will 
 end at midnight\, but the party will go on till we drop. If public transit
  agencies work as in previous years\, we expect that BART will offer speci
 al service from 8 PM December 31\, 2026\, till 3 AM January 1\, 2027\; and
  MUNI will offer free NYE service from 8 PM December 31\, 2026\, till 5 AM
  January 1\, 2027. For a list of restaurant recommendations in the area\, 
 please visit our website.\n\nWe encourage everyone 21+ to party with us a.
 ..\n\n$75\, 18+\nCTT Comedy presents\n\nTickets: https://tickets.cttcomedy
 .com/events/2676/cheaper-than-therapy-stand-up-comedy-new-year-s-eve-2026-
 10-30-pm/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/31/cheaper-than-th
 erapy-new-year-s-eve-2026-10-30-pm-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.78902490000001;-122.4091439
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34751928/319c158d-72cf-432e-b405-d0f8b3e47826.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261101T160546Z
LOCATION:Shelton Theater\, 533 Sutter St.\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/31/cheaper-than-therapy-new-year-s
 -eve-2026-10-30-pm-tickets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:San Francisco New Year’s Eve Fireworks at Midnight (2026/2027)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261231T235900
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270101T025900
DTSTAMP:20261105T012941Z
UID:funcheap-124809@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Fairs Festivals
DESCRIPTION:David Yu Ring in 2027 with San Francisco’s annual fireworks 
 show over the Bay.\nThe big fireworks show will take place at midnight thi
 s year (December 31\, 2026) on New Year’s Eve 2026/2027.\nSay goodbye to
  2026 and ring in the 2027 new year with 200\,000 fellow bundled-up San Fr
 anciscans for an annual tradition as the city once again hosts a free wate
 rfront midnight fireworks show on New Year’s Eve.\n\nSan Francisco New Y
 ear’s Eve Fireworks\nThursday\, December 31\, 2026 | 11:59 pm\nEmbarcade
 ro from Mission to Folsom\nFREE\nArrive by 11:30 pm and head south of the 
 Ferry Building along the Embarcadero for the best view. Fireworks kick off
  right at the stroke of midnight.\nThe info below is from past years\, but
  this is what typically happens at SF’s NYE fireworks. We will update th
 is post as soon as we have the confirmed details.\nBest SF Fireworks Viewi
 ng Location:\nThe fireworks typically launch from barges located 1\,000 fe
 et out in the bay\, just south of the Ferry Building near Pier 14 (Mission
  Street and The Embarcadero)\, so the best viewing spots will be south of 
 the Ferry Building along the Embarcadero between Mission and Folsom Street
 .\nPlease note that standing in front of the Ferry Building will not be a 
 good place to view the fireworks. It’s way too crowded\, and your view c
 an be blocked by the Ferry Building.\nAbout the Fireworks Show:\n\nTypical
 ly\, there’s a 15-minute midnight fireworks show. Each year\, they unvei
 l a few new and interesting pyrotechnics.\nThe fireworks are usually sync.
 ..\n\nFree\n\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/san-francisco-new-years-eve
 -fireworks/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/nyefir
 eworks.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261105T012941Z
LOCATION:Embarcadero\, 4 Embarcadero Center\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/san-francisco-new-years-eve-fireworks/
END:VEVENT
