CATEGORIES:DJ/Parties
DESCRIPTION:It's A New DAY + Breakfast Of Champions 2027 is coming back to
  The Great Northern block for a full day + night of New Year shenanigans!\
 n\nWe’re kicking off the year again with the ultimate BLOCK PARTY in the
  heart of San Francisco!\n\nITS A NEW DAY & BOC is bringing that yearly HE
 AT that gets the whole bay area moving on New Year!\nExpect diversity of m
 usic\, food\, dancing and frolicking in the streets: GOOD VIBES ONLY as we
