SUMMARY:Megalopolis
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270101T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270101T180000
DTSTAMP:20261102T193355Z
UID:dothebay-17979582@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Like the famed empire that Francis Ford Coppola’s epic passi
 on project is styled after\, MEGALOPOLIS is a towering\, monumental specta
 cle that most people will think about at least once a day. The City of New
  Rome is at a crossroads. At one end sits Cesar Catilina (Adam Driver)\, t
 he idealistic artist striving for a utopian future\, and at the other sits
  Mayor Franklin Cicero (Giancarlo Esposito)\, a powerful figure perpetuati
 ng greed\, special interests\, and partisan warfare. Their titanic struggl
 e will shake the foundations of their city and lay the groundwork for a ne
 w tomorrow.\n\nAs engrossing and ambitious as you would expect from the fi
 lmmaker behind THE GODFATHER and APOCALYPSE NOW\, MEGALOPOLIS is an unforg
 ettable vision that could only have come from Coppola. Of course\, he didn
 ’t do it alone\, and everyone in the unbelievable cast (including Driver
 \, Esposito\, Nathalie Emmanuel\, Aubrey Plaza\, Laurence Fishburne\, and 
 more) delivers some of the most memorable performances of their careers.\n
 \nTickets: https://drafthouse.com/sf/show/special-event-megalopolis-new-ye
 ars-day-celebration?cinemaId=0802&sessionId=22980\nDetails: https://dotheb
 ay.com/events/2027/1/1/megalopolis-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7562198;-122.419185
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35067971/3909476f-05d7-4795-9a24-4f5dd5430bdc.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261102T193355Z
LOCATION:Alamo Drafthouse Cinema\, 2550 Mission St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94110
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2027/1/1/megalopolis-tickets
END:VEVENT
