 ecial guest Felissa Rose\n\nThursday\, January 7 | The Castro\n\nJoin cult
  filmmaker and drag icon Peaches Christ\, Sleepaway Camp star Felissa Rose
 \, and filmmaker and podcaster Michael Varrati for an unforgettable evenin
 g celebrating one of the most gloriously shocking horror films of all time
 ! The event begins with a live pre-show featuring performances\, conversat
 ion\, behind-the-scenes stories\, audience participation\, and a 1980s Cam
 p Costume Contest\, followed by a screening of Sleepaway Camp. A limited V
 IP Meet & Greet experience will also be available.\n\nThis event is Rated 
 R.**\n\n**This film is rated R. Children under age 17 require an accompany
 ing parent or guardian (age 21 or older) to attend R rated screenings. 25 
 years and under may be asked to show ID for R rated screenings.\n\n$27.75 
