SUMMARY:Live on The Stoop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270107T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270107T220000
DTSTAMP:20261108T194419Z
UID:dothebay-17865942@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Please note - there is a delivery delay set for 2 weeks prior 
 to show.\n\nLive On The Stoop began as a series of pop-up shows in the Fil
 lmore District with The Top Chefs\, a collective of musicians rooted in th
 e city. It has since evolved into a platform where artists from around the
  world can reimagine their songs live with the band. Now\, we're bringing 
 the Stoop experience to The Independent\, just two blocks away from the ho
 me where the movement began.\n\nThis show won't simply recreate the pop-up
 s that our neighbors have come to know and love. It's a narrative-driven m
 ultimedia stage production celebrating San Francisco's musical history\, f
 rom the Fillmore jazz era to the Summer Of Love to mobb music and beyond. 
 If you love this city and its true culture\, you won't want to miss it.\n\
 n$28.86\, 18+\nAnother Planet Entertainment Presents\n\nTickets: https://t
 icketmaster.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=https%3A%2F%2
 Fwww.ticketweb.com%2Fevent%2Flive-on-the-stoop-the-independent-tickets%2F1
 4316534%3FREFERRAL_ID%3Dtmfeedbuyat234705%26wt.mc_id%3Daff_BUYAT_234705%26
 camefrom%3DCFC_BUYAT_234705\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2027/1/7
 /live-on-the-stoop-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
